#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:1921
msgid "Managers"
msgstr "管理器"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:1923
msgid ""
"Managers provide a way to create data which can be shared between different "
"processes, including sharing over a network between processes running on "
"different machines. A manager object controls a server process which manages "
"*shared objects*.  Other processes can access the shared objects by using "
"proxies."
msgstr ""
"管理器提供了一種建立可在不同行程間共享之資料的方式，包括透過網路在不同機器上"
"執行的行程之間共享。管理器物件控制一個伺服器行程，由該行程管理\\ *共享物件*。"
"其他行程可以透過代理物件存取這些共享物件。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:1932
msgid ""
"Returns a started :class:`~multiprocessing.managers.SyncManager` object "
"which can be used for sharing objects between processes.  The returned "
"manager object corresponds to a spawned child process and has methods which "
"will create shared objects and return corresponding proxies."
msgstr ""
"回傳一個已啟動的 :class:`~multiprocessing.managers.SyncManager` 物件，可用於"
"在行程之間共享物件。回傳的管理器物件對應到一個衍生出的子行程，並具有可建立共"
"享物件並回傳對應代理物件的方法。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:1940
msgid ""
"Manager processes will be shutdown as soon as they are garbage collected or "
"their parent process exits.  The manager classes are defined in "
"the :mod:`multiprocessing.managers` module:"
msgstr ""
"管理器行程會在被垃圾回收或其父行程結束時立即關閉。管理器類別定義"
"在 :mod:`multiprocessing.managers` 模組中："

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:1946
msgid "Create a BaseManager object."
msgstr "建立一個 BaseManager 物件。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:1948
msgid ""
"Once created one should call :meth:`start` or "
"``get_server().serve_forever()`` to ensure that the manager object refers to "
"a started manager process."
msgstr ""
"建立之後，應呼叫 :meth:`start` 或 ``get_server().serve_forever()``，以確保管"
"理器物件參照到一個已啟動的管理器行程。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:1951
msgid ""
"*address* is the address on which the manager process listens for new "
"connections.  If *address* is ``None`` then an arbitrary one is chosen."
msgstr ""
"*address* 是管理器行程監聽新連線的位址。如果 *address* 為 ``None``，則會任意"
"選擇一個位址。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:1954
msgid ""
"*authkey* is the authentication key which will be used to check the validity "
"of incoming connections to the server process.  If *authkey* is ``None`` "
"then ``current_process().authkey`` is used. Otherwise *authkey* is used and "
"it must be a byte string."
msgstr ""
"*authkey* 是驗證金鑰，用於檢查連入伺服器行程之連線的有效性。如果 *authkey* "
"為 ``None``，則會使用 ``current_process().authkey``；否則會使用 *authkey*，且"
"它必須是位元組串。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:1959
msgid ""
"*serializer* must be ``'pickle'`` (use :mod:`pickle` serialization) or "
"``'xmlrpclib'`` (use :mod:`xmlrpc.client` serialization)."
msgstr ""
"*serializer* 必須是 ``'pickle'``\\ （使用 :mod:`pickle` 序列化）或 "
"``'xmlrpclib'``\\ （使用 :mod:`xmlrpc.client` 序列化）。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:1966
msgid ""
"*shutdown_timeout* is a timeout in seconds used to wait until the process "
"used by the manager completes in the :meth:`shutdown` method. If the "
"shutdown times out, the process is terminated. If terminating the process "
"also times out, the process is killed."
msgstr ""
"*shutdown_timeout* 是以秒為單位的超時時間，用於在 :meth:`shutdown` 方法中等待"
"管理器所使用的行程完成。如果關閉超時，該行程會被終止；如果終止行程也超時，該"
"行程會被強制終止 (kill)。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:1971
msgid "Added the *shutdown_timeout* parameter."
msgstr "新增 *shutdown_timeout* 參數。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:1976
msgid ""
"Start a subprocess to start the manager.  If *initializer* is not ``None`` "
"then the subprocess will call ``initializer(*initargs)`` when it starts."
msgstr ""
"啟動一個子行程來啟動管理器。如果 *initializer* 不是 ``None``，子行程在啟動時"
"會呼叫 ``initializer(*initargs)``。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:1981
msgid ""
"Returns a :class:`Server` object which represents the actual server under "
"the control of the Manager. The :class:`Server` object supports "
"the :meth:`serve_forever` method::"
msgstr ""
"回傳一個 :class:`Server` 物件，代表受管理器控制的實際伺服器。:class:`Server` "
"物件支援 :meth:`serve_forever` 方法： ::"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:1985
msgid ""
">>> from multiprocessing.managers import BaseManager\n"
">>> manager = BaseManager(address=('', 50000), authkey=b'abc')\n"
">>> server = manager.get_server()\n"
">>> server.serve_forever()"
msgstr ""
">>> from multiprocessing.managers import BaseManager\n"
">>> manager = BaseManager(address=('', 50000), authkey=b'abc')\n"
">>> server = manager.get_server()\n"
">>> server.serve_forever()"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:1990
msgid ":class:`Server` additionally has an :attr:`address` attribute."
msgstr ":class:`Server` 另外還有一個 :attr:`address` 屬性。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:1994
msgid "Connect a local manager object to a remote manager process::"
msgstr "將本地管理器物件連線到遠端管理器行程： ::"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:1996
msgid ""
">>> from multiprocessing.managers import BaseManager\n"
">>> m = BaseManager(address=('127.0.0.1', 50000), authkey=b'abc')\n"
">>> m.connect()"
msgstr ""
">>> from multiprocessing.managers import BaseManager\n"
">>> m = BaseManager(address=('127.0.0.1', 50000), authkey=b'abc')\n"
">>> m.connect()"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2002
msgid ""
"Stop the process used by the manager.  This is only available "
"if :meth:`start` has been used to start the server process."
msgstr ""
"停止管理器所使用的行程。只有在曾使用 :meth:`start` 啟動伺服器行程時才能使用此"
"方法。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2005
msgid "This can be called multiple times."
msgstr "此方法可以被呼叫多次。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2009
msgid ""
"A classmethod which can be used for registering a type or callable with the "
"manager class."
msgstr "一個類別方法，可用於向管理器類別註冊型別或可呼叫物件。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2012
msgid ""
"*typeid* is a \"type identifier\" which is used to identify a particular "
"type of shared object.  This must be a string."
msgstr ""
"*typeid* 是一個「型別識別碼」，用於識別特定型別的共享物件。它必須是字串。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2015
msgid ""
"*callable* is a callable used for creating objects for this type "
"identifier.  If a manager instance will be connected to the server using "
"the :meth:`connect` method, or if the *create_method* argument is ``False`` "
"then this can be left as ``None``."
msgstr ""
"*callable* 是用於為此型別識別碼建立物件的可呼叫物件。如果管理器實例將使"
"用 :meth:`connect` 方法連線到伺服器，或者 *create_method* 引數為 ``False``，"
"則此項可以保留為 ``None``。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2021
msgid ""
"*proxytype* is a subclass of :class:`BaseProxy` which is used to create "
"proxies for shared objects with this *typeid*.  If ``None`` then a proxy "
"class is created automatically."
msgstr ""
"*proxytype* 是 :class:`BaseProxy` 的子類別，用於為具有此 *typeid* 的共享物件"
"建立代理物件。如果為 ``None``，則會自動建立一個代理類別。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2025
msgid ""
"*exposed* is used to specify a sequence of method names which proxies for "
"this typeid should be allowed to access "
"using :meth:`BaseProxy._callmethod`.  (If *exposed* is ``None`` "
"then :attr:`proxytype._exposed_` is used instead if it exists.)  In the case "
"where no exposed list is specified, all \"public methods\" of the shared "
"object will be accessible.  (Here a \"public method\" means any attribute "
"which has a :meth:`~object.__call__` method and whose name does not begin "
"with ``'_'``.)"
msgstr ""
"*exposed* 用於指定一個方法名稱的序列，此 typeid 的代理物件應被允許使"
"用 :meth:`BaseProxy._callmethod` 存取這些方法。（如果 *exposed* 為 ``None``，"
"且 :attr:`proxytype._exposed_` 存在，則會改用它。）在沒有指定 exposed 串列的"
"情況下，共享物件的所有「公開方法」都可以被存取。（此處的「公開方法」是指任何"
"具有 :meth:`~object.__call__` 方法且名稱不以 ``'_'`` 開頭的屬性。）"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2034
msgid ""
"*method_to_typeid* is a mapping used to specify the return type of those "
"exposed methods which should return a proxy.  It maps method names to typeid "
"strings.  (If *method_to_typeid* is ``None`` "
"then :attr:`proxytype._method_to_typeid_` is used instead if it exists.)  If "
"a method's name is not a key of this mapping or if the mapping is ``None`` "
"then the object returned by the method will be copied by value."
msgstr ""
"*method_to_typeid* 是一個對映，用於為那些應回傳代理物件的已開放 (exposed) 方"
"法指定回傳型別。它將方法名稱對映到 typeid 字串。（如果 *method_to_typeid* 為 "
"``None``，且 :attr:`proxytype._method_to_typeid_` 存在，則會改用它。）如果方"
"法名稱不是此對映的鍵，或者對映為 ``None``，則該方法回傳的物件會以傳值的方式複"
"製。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2041
msgid ""
"*create_method* determines whether a method should be created with name "
"*typeid* which can be used to tell the server process to create a new shared "
"object and return a proxy for it.  By default it is ``True``."
msgstr ""
"*create_method* 決定是否應建立一個名為 *typeid* 的方法，該方法可用於告知伺服"
"器行程建立新的共享物件並回傳其代理物件。預設為 ``True``。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2045
msgid ":class:`BaseManager` instances also have one read-only property:"
msgstr ":class:`BaseManager` 實例也有一個唯讀屬性："

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2049
msgid "The address used by the manager."
msgstr "管理器所使用的位址。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2051
msgid ""
"Manager objects support the context management protocol -- "
"see :ref:`typecontextmanager`.  :meth:`~contextmanager.__enter__` starts the "
"server process (if it has not already started) and then returns the manager "
"object.  :meth:`~contextmanager.__exit__` calls :meth:`shutdown`."
msgstr ""
"管理器物件支援情境管理協定，請參閱"
"\\ :ref:`typecontextmanager`。:meth:`~contextmanager.__enter__` 會啟動伺服器"
"行程（如果尚未啟動的話）並回傳管理器物件。:meth:`~contextmanager.__exit__` 會"
"呼叫 :meth:`shutdown`。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2057
msgid ""
"In previous versions :meth:`~contextmanager.__enter__` did not start the "
"manager's server process if it was not already started."
msgstr ""
"在之前的版本中，如果管理器的伺服器行程尚未啟"
"動，:meth:`~contextmanager.__enter__` 並不會啟動它。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2062
msgid ""
"A subclass of :class:`BaseManager` which can be used for the synchronization "
"of processes.  Objects of this type are returned "
"by :func:`multiprocessing.Manager`."
msgstr ""
":class:`BaseManager` 的子類別，可用於行程間的同步。此型別的物件"
"由 :func:`multiprocessing.Manager` 回傳。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2066
msgid ""
"Its methods create and return :ref:`multiprocessing-proxy_objects` for a "
"number of commonly used data types to be synchronized across processes. This "
"notably includes shared lists and dictionaries."
msgstr ""
"它的方法會為許多常用的資料型別建立並回傳\\ :ref:`multiprocessing-"
"proxy_objects`，以便在行程之間同步。其中特別包括共享的串列和字典。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2072
msgid ""
"Create a shared :class:`threading.Barrier` object and return a proxy for it."
msgstr "建立一個共享的 :class:`threading.Barrier` 物件並回傳其代理物件。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2079
msgid ""
"Create a shared :class:`threading.BoundedSemaphore` object and return a "
"proxy for it."
msgstr ""
"建立一個共享的 :class:`threading.BoundedSemaphore` 物件並回傳其代理物件。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2084
msgid ""
"Create a shared :class:`threading.Condition` object and return a proxy for "
"it."
msgstr "建立一個共享的 :class:`threading.Condition` 物件並回傳其代理物件。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2087
msgid ""
"If *lock* is supplied then it should be a proxy for "
"a :class:`threading.Lock` or :class:`threading.RLock` object."
msgstr ""
"如果有提供 *lock*，它應該是 :class:`threading.Lock` "
"或 :class:`threading.RLock` 物件的代理物件。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2095
msgid ""
"Create a shared :class:`threading.Event` object and return a proxy for it."
msgstr "建立一個共享的 :class:`threading.Event` 物件並回傳其代理物件。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2099
msgid ""
"Create a shared :class:`threading.Lock` object and return a proxy for it."
msgstr "建立一個共享的 :class:`threading.Lock` 物件並回傳其代理物件。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2103
msgid "Create a shared :class:`Namespace` object and return a proxy for it."
msgstr "建立一個共享的 :class:`Namespace` 物件並回傳其代理物件。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2107
msgid "Create a shared :class:`queue.Queue` object and return a proxy for it."
msgstr "建立一個共享的 :class:`queue.Queue` 物件並回傳其代理物件。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2111
msgid ""
"Create a shared :class:`threading.RLock` object and return a proxy for it."
msgstr "建立一個共享的 :class:`threading.RLock` 物件並回傳其代理物件。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2115
msgid ""
"Create a shared :class:`threading.Semaphore` object and return a proxy for "
"it."
msgstr "建立一個共享的 :class:`threading.Semaphore` 物件並回傳其代理物件。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2120
msgid "Create an array and return a proxy for it."
msgstr "建立一個陣列並回傳其代理物件。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2124
msgid ""
"Create an object with a writable ``value`` attribute and return a proxy for "
"it."
msgstr "建立一個具有可寫入 ``value`` 屬性的物件並回傳其代理物件。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2131
msgid "Create a shared :class:`dict` object and return a proxy for it."
msgstr "建立一個共享的 :class:`dict` 物件並回傳其代理物件。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2136
msgid "Create a shared :class:`list` object and return a proxy for it."
msgstr "建立一個共享的 :class:`list` 物件並回傳其代理物件。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2142
msgid "Create a shared :class:`set` object and return a proxy for it."
msgstr "建立一個共享的 :class:`set` 物件並回傳其代理物件。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2144
msgid ":class:`set` support was added."
msgstr "已新增對 :class:`set` 的支援。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2147
msgid ""
"Shared objects are capable of being nested.  For example, a shared container "
"object such as a shared list can contain other shared objects which will all "
"be managed and synchronized by the :class:`SyncManager`."
msgstr ""
"共享物件可以巢狀使用。例如，像共享串列這樣的共享容器物件可以包含其他共享物"
"件，而這些物件全都會由 :class:`SyncManager` 管理與同步。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2154
msgid "A type that can register with :class:`SyncManager`."
msgstr "可以向 :class:`SyncManager` 註冊的型別。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2156
msgid ""
"A namespace object has no public methods, but does have writable attributes. "
"Its representation shows the values of its attributes."
msgstr ""
"命名空間物件沒有公開方法，但有可寫入的屬性。它的表示法會顯示其屬性的值。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2159
msgid ""
"However, when using a proxy for a namespace object, an attribute beginning "
"with ``'_'`` will be an attribute of the proxy and not an attribute of the "
"referent:"
msgstr ""
"然而，在使用命名空間物件的代理物件時，以 ``'_'`` 開頭的屬性會是代理物件的屬"
"性，而不是參照目標 (referent) 的屬性："

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2163
msgid ""
">>> mp_context = multiprocessing.get_context('spawn')\n"
">>> manager = mp_context.Manager()\n"
">>> Global = manager.Namespace()\n"
">>> Global.x = 10\n"
">>> Global.y = 'hello'\n"
">>> Global._z = 12.3    # this is an attribute of the proxy\n"
">>> print(Global)\n"
"Namespace(x=10, y='hello')"
msgstr ""
">>> mp_context = multiprocessing.get_context('spawn')\n"
">>> manager = mp_context.Manager()\n"
">>> Global = manager.Namespace()\n"
">>> Global.x = 10\n"
">>> Global.y = 'hello'\n"
">>> Global._z = 12.3    # 這是代理物件的屬性\n"
">>> print(Global)\n"
"Namespace(x=10, y='hello')"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2176
msgid "Customized managers"
msgstr "自訂管理器"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2178
msgid ""
"To create one's own manager, one creates a subclass of :class:`BaseManager` "
"and uses the :meth:`~BaseManager.register` classmethod to register new types "
"or callables with the manager class.  For example::"
msgstr ""
"若要建立自己的管理器，可以建立 :class:`BaseManager` 的子類別，並使"
"用 :meth:`~BaseManager.register` 類別方法向管理器類別註冊新的型別或可呼叫物"
"件。例如： ::"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2182
msgid ""
"from multiprocessing.managers import BaseManager\n"
"\n"
"class MathsClass:\n"
"    def add(self, x, y):\n"
"        return x + y\n"
"    def mul(self, x, y):\n"
"        return x * y\n"
"\n"
"class MyManager(BaseManager):\n"
"    pass\n"
"\n"
"MyManager.register('Maths', MathsClass)\n"
"\n"
"if __name__ == '__main__':\n"
"    with MyManager() as manager:\n"
"        maths = manager.Maths()\n"
"        print(maths.add(4, 3))         # prints 7\n"
"        print(maths.mul(7, 8))         # prints 56"
msgstr ""
"from multiprocessing.managers import BaseManager\n"
"\n"
"class MathsClass:\n"
"    def add(self, x, y):\n"
"        return x + y\n"
"    def mul(self, x, y):\n"
"        return x * y\n"
"\n"
"class MyManager(BaseManager):\n"
"    pass\n"
"\n"
"MyManager.register('Maths', MathsClass)\n"
"\n"
"if __name__ == '__main__':\n"
"    with MyManager() as manager:\n"
"        maths = manager.Maths()\n"
"        print(maths.add(4, 3))         # 印出 7\n"
"        print(maths.mul(7, 8))         # 印出 56"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2203
msgid "Using a remote manager"
msgstr "使用遠端管理器"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2205
msgid ""
"It is possible to run a manager server on one machine and have clients use "
"it from other machines (assuming that the firewalls involved allow it)."
msgstr ""
"可以在一台機器上執行管理器伺服器，並讓用戶端從其他機器使用它（前提是相關的防"
"火牆允許）。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2208
msgid ""
"Running the following commands creates a server for a single shared queue "
"which remote clients can access::"
msgstr "執行以下命令會為單一共享佇列建立一個伺服器，讓遠端用戶端可以存取： ::"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2211
msgid ""
">>> from multiprocessing.managers import BaseManager\n"
">>> from queue import Queue\n"
">>> queue = Queue()\n"
">>> class QueueManager(BaseManager): pass\n"
">>> QueueManager.register('get_queue', callable=lambda:queue)\n"
">>> m = QueueManager(address=('', 50000), authkey=b'abracadabra')\n"
">>> s = m.get_server()\n"
">>> s.serve_forever()"
msgstr ""
">>> from multiprocessing.managers import BaseManager\n"
">>> from queue import Queue\n"
">>> queue = Queue()\n"
">>> class QueueManager(BaseManager): pass\n"
">>> QueueManager.register('get_queue', callable=lambda:queue)\n"
">>> m = QueueManager(address=('', 50000), authkey=b'abracadabra')\n"
">>> s = m.get_server()\n"
">>> s.serve_forever()"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2220
msgid "One client can access the server as follows::"
msgstr "一個用戶端可以如下存取該伺服器： ::"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2222
msgid ""
">>> from multiprocessing.managers import BaseManager\n"
">>> class QueueManager(BaseManager): pass\n"
">>> QueueManager.register('get_queue')\n"
">>> m = QueueManager(address=('foo.bar.org', 50000), "
"authkey=b'abracadabra')\n"
">>> m.connect()\n"
">>> queue = m.get_queue()\n"
">>> queue.put('hello')"
msgstr ""
">>> from multiprocessing.managers import BaseManager\n"
">>> class QueueManager(BaseManager): pass\n"
">>> QueueManager.register('get_queue')\n"
">>> m = QueueManager(address=('foo.bar.org', 50000), "
"authkey=b'abracadabra')\n"
">>> m.connect()\n"
">>> queue = m.get_queue()\n"
">>> queue.put('hello')"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2230
msgid "Another client can also use it::"
msgstr "另一個用戶端也可以使用它： ::"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2232
msgid ""
">>> from multiprocessing.managers import BaseManager\n"
">>> class QueueManager(BaseManager): pass\n"
">>> QueueManager.register('get_queue')\n"
">>> m = QueueManager(address=('foo.bar.org', 50000), "
"authkey=b'abracadabra')\n"
">>> m.connect()\n"
">>> queue = m.get_queue()\n"
">>> queue.get()\n"
"'hello'"
msgstr ""
">>> from multiprocessing.managers import BaseManager\n"
">>> class QueueManager(BaseManager): pass\n"
">>> QueueManager.register('get_queue')\n"
">>> m = QueueManager(address=('foo.bar.org', 50000), "
"authkey=b'abracadabra')\n"
">>> m.connect()\n"
">>> queue = m.get_queue()\n"
">>> queue.get()\n"
"'hello'"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2241
msgid ""
"Local processes can also access that queue, using the code from above on the "
"client to access it remotely::"
msgstr ""
"本地行程也可以存取該佇列，只要使用上面用戶端遠端存取它的程式碼即可： ::"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2244
msgid ""
">>> from multiprocessing import Process, Queue\n"
">>> from multiprocessing.managers import BaseManager\n"
">>> class Worker(Process):\n"
"...     def __init__(self, q):\n"
"...         self.q = q\n"
"...         super().__init__()\n"
"...     def run(self):\n"
"...         self.q.put('local hello')\n"
"...\n"
">>> queue = Queue()\n"
">>> w = Worker(queue)\n"
">>> w.start()\n"
">>> class QueueManager(BaseManager): pass\n"
"...\n"
">>> QueueManager.register('get_queue', callable=lambda: queue)\n"
">>> m = QueueManager(address=('', 50000), authkey=b'abracadabra')\n"
">>> s = m.get_server()\n"
">>> s.serve_forever()"
msgstr ""
">>> from multiprocessing import Process, Queue\n"
">>> from multiprocessing.managers import BaseManager\n"
">>> class Worker(Process):\n"
"...     def __init__(self, q):\n"
"...         self.q = q\n"
"...         super().__init__()\n"
"...     def run(self):\n"
"...         self.q.put('local hello')\n"
"...\n"
">>> queue = Queue()\n"
">>> w = Worker(queue)\n"
">>> w.start()\n"
">>> class QueueManager(BaseManager): pass\n"
"...\n"
">>> QueueManager.register('get_queue', callable=lambda: queue)\n"
">>> m = QueueManager(address=('', 50000), authkey=b'abracadabra')\n"
">>> s = m.get_server()\n"
">>> s.serve_forever()"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2266
msgid "Proxy Objects"
msgstr "代理物件"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2268
msgid ""
"A proxy is an object which *refers* to a shared object which lives "
"(presumably) in a different process.  The shared object is said to be the "
"*referent* of the proxy.  Multiple proxy objects may have the same referent."
msgstr ""
"代理物件是一個會\\ *參照*\\ 某個共享物件的物件，而該共享物件（應該）存在於另"
"一個行程中。這個共享物件稱為該代理物件的\\ *參照目標*。多個代理物件可以有相同"
"的參照目標。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2272
msgid ""
"A proxy object has methods which invoke corresponding methods of its "
"referent (although not every method of the referent will necessarily be "
"available through the proxy).  In this way, a proxy can be used just like "
"its referent can:"
msgstr ""
"代理物件具有會叫用其參照目標對應方法的方法（不過參照目標的每個方法不一定都能"
"透過代理物件使用）。如此一來，代理物件就能像其參照目標一樣地使用："

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2276
msgid ""
">>> mp_context = multiprocessing.get_context('spawn')\n"
">>> manager = mp_context.Manager()\n"
">>> l = manager.list([i*i for i in range(10)])\n"
">>> print(l)\n"
"[0, 1, 4, 9, 16, 25, 36, 49, 64, 81]\n"
">>> print(repr(l))\n"
"<ListProxy object, typeid 'list' at 0x...>\n"
">>> l[4]\n"
"16\n"
">>> l[2:5]\n"
"[4, 9, 16]"
msgstr ""
">>> mp_context = multiprocessing.get_context('spawn')\n"
">>> manager = mp_context.Manager()\n"
">>> l = manager.list([i*i for i in range(10)])\n"
">>> print(l)\n"
"[0, 1, 4, 9, 16, 25, 36, 49, 64, 81]\n"
">>> print(repr(l))\n"
"<ListProxy object, typeid 'list' at 0x...>\n"
">>> l[4]\n"
"16\n"
">>> l[2:5]\n"
"[4, 9, 16]"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2290
msgid ""
"Notice that applying :func:`str` to a proxy will return the representation "
"of the referent, whereas applying :func:`repr` will return the "
"representation of the proxy."
msgstr ""
"請注意，對代理物件套用 :func:`str` 會回傳參照目標的表示法，而套"
"用 :func:`repr` 則會回傳代理物件的表示法。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2294
msgid ""
"An important feature of proxy objects is that they are picklable so they can "
"be passed between processes.  As such, a referent can "
"contain :ref:`multiprocessing-proxy_objects`.  This permits nesting of these "
"managed lists, dicts, and other :ref:`multiprocessing-proxy_objects`:"
msgstr ""
"代理物件的一個重要特性是它們可以被封裝，所以能在行程之間傳遞。因此，參照目標"
"可以包含\\ :ref:`multiprocessing-proxy_objects`。這使得這些受管理的串列、字典"
"及其他\\ :ref:`multiprocessing-proxy_objects`\\ 可以巢狀使用："

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2299
msgid ""
">>> a = manager.list()\n"
">>> b = manager.list()\n"
">>> a.append(b)         # referent of a now contains referent of b\n"
">>> print(a, b)\n"
"[<ListProxy object, typeid 'list' at ...>] []\n"
">>> b.append('hello')\n"
">>> print(a[0], b)\n"
"['hello'] ['hello']"
msgstr ""
">>> a = manager.list()\n"
">>> b = manager.list()\n"
">>> a.append(b)         # a 的參照目標現在包含 b 的參照目標\n"
">>> print(a, b)\n"
"[<ListProxy object, typeid 'list' at ...>] []\n"
">>> b.append('hello')\n"
">>> print(a[0], b)\n"
"['hello'] ['hello']"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2310
msgid "Similarly, dict and list proxies may be nested inside one another::"
msgstr "同樣地，字典和串列的代理物件也可以互相巢狀： ::"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2312
msgid ""
">>> l_outer = manager.list([ manager.dict() for i in range(2) ])\n"
">>> d_first_inner = l_outer[0]\n"
">>> d_first_inner['a'] = 1\n"
">>> d_first_inner['b'] = 2\n"
">>> l_outer[1]['c'] = 3\n"
">>> l_outer[1]['z'] = 26\n"
">>> print(l_outer[0])\n"
"{'a': 1, 'b': 2}\n"
">>> print(l_outer[1])\n"
"{'c': 3, 'z': 26}"
msgstr ""
">>> l_outer = manager.list([ manager.dict() for i in range(2) ])\n"
">>> d_first_inner = l_outer[0]\n"
">>> d_first_inner['a'] = 1\n"
">>> d_first_inner['b'] = 2\n"
">>> l_outer[1]['c'] = 3\n"
">>> l_outer[1]['z'] = 26\n"
">>> print(l_outer[0])\n"
"{'a': 1, 'b': 2}\n"
">>> print(l_outer[1])\n"
"{'c': 3, 'z': 26}"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2323
msgid ""
"If standard (non-proxy) :class:`list` or :class:`dict` objects are contained "
"in a referent, modifications to those mutable values will not be propagated "
"through the manager because the proxy has no way of knowing when the values "
"contained within are modified.  However, storing a value in a container "
"proxy (which triggers a ``__setitem__`` on the proxy object) does propagate "
"through the manager and so to effectively modify such an item, one could re-"
"assign the modified value to the container proxy::"
msgstr ""
"如果參照目標中包含標準（非代理）的 :class:`list` 或 :class:`dict` 物件，對這"
"些可變值的修改將不會透過管理器傳播，因為代理物件無從得知其中所包含的值何時被"
"修改。然而，將值儲存到容器代理物件中（這會觸發代理物件上的 ``__setitem__``）"
"確實會透過管理器傳播，因此若要有效地修改這類項目，可以將修改後的值重新指派給"
"容器代理物件： ::"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2331
msgid ""
"# create a list proxy and append a mutable object (a dictionary)\n"
"lproxy = manager.list()\n"
"lproxy.append({})\n"
"# now mutate the dictionary\n"
"d = lproxy[0]\n"
"d['a'] = 1\n"
"d['b'] = 2\n"
"# at this point, the changes to d are not yet synced, but by\n"
"# updating the dictionary, the proxy is notified of the change\n"
"lproxy[0] = d"
msgstr ""
"# 建立一個串列代理物件，並附加一個可變物件（字典）\n"
"lproxy = manager.list()\n"
"lproxy.append({})\n"
"# 現在修改這個字典\n"
"d = lproxy[0]\n"
"d['a'] = 1\n"
"d['b'] = 2\n"
"# 此時對 d 的修改尚未同步，但藉由\n"
"# 更新字典，代理物件就會收到變更的通知\n"
"lproxy[0] = d"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2342
msgid ""
"This approach is perhaps less convenient than employing "
"nested :ref:`multiprocessing-proxy_objects` for most use cases but also "
"demonstrates a level of control over the synchronization."
msgstr ""
"對大多數使用情境來說，這種做法可能不如使用巢狀的\\ :ref:`multiprocessing-"
"proxy_objects`\\ 方便，但也展示了對同步進行某種程度的控制。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2348
msgid ""
"The proxy types in :mod:`!multiprocessing` do nothing to support comparisons "
"by value.  So, for instance, we have:"
msgstr ""
":mod:`!multiprocessing` 中的代理型別完全不支援以值進行比較。因此舉例來說，會"
"得到："

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2351
msgid ""
">>> manager.list([1,2,3]) == [1,2,3]\n"
"False"
msgstr ""
">>> manager.list([1,2,3]) == [1,2,3]\n"
"False"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2356
msgid ""
"One should just use a copy of the referent instead when making comparisons."
msgstr "進行比較時，應該改用參照目標的副本。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2360
msgid "Proxy objects are instances of subclasses of :class:`BaseProxy`."
msgstr "代理物件是 :class:`BaseProxy` 子類別的實例。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2364
msgid "Call and return the result of a method of the proxy's referent."
msgstr "呼叫代理物件之參照目標的某個方法並回傳其結果。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2366
msgid ""
"If ``proxy`` is a proxy whose referent is ``obj`` then the expression ::"
msgstr "如果 ``proxy`` 是一個參照目標為 ``obj`` 的代理物件，那麼運算式 ::"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2368
msgid "proxy._callmethod(methodname, args, kwds)"
msgstr "proxy._callmethod(methodname, args, kwds)"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2370
msgid "will evaluate the expression ::"
msgstr "會對以下運算式求值 ::"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2372
msgid "getattr(obj, methodname)(*args, **kwds)"
msgstr "getattr(obj, methodname)(*args, **kwds)"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2374
msgid "in the manager's process."
msgstr "而此求值是在管理器的行程中進行。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2376
msgid ""
"The returned value will be a copy of the result of the call or a proxy to a "
"new shared object -- see documentation for the *method_to_typeid* argument "
"of :meth:`BaseManager.register`."
msgstr ""
"回傳的值會是該呼叫結果的副本，或是一個新共享物件的代理物件；詳"
"見 :meth:`BaseManager.register` 的 *method_to_typeid* 引數的說明文件。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2380
msgid ""
"If an exception is raised by the call, then is re-raised "
"by :meth:`_callmethod`.  If some other exception is raised in the manager's "
"process then this is converted into a :exc:`RemoteError` exception and is "
"raised by :meth:`_callmethod`."
msgstr ""
"如果該呼叫引發了例外，則該例外會由 :meth:`_callmethod` 重新引發。如果在管理器"
"的行程中引發了其他例外，則該例外會被轉換為 :exc:`RemoteError` 例外，並"
"由 :meth:`_callmethod` 引發。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2385
msgid ""
"Note in particular that an exception will be raised if *methodname* has not "
"been *exposed*."
msgstr "特別注意，如果 *methodname* 未被\\ *開放*，則會引發例外。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2388
msgid "An example of the usage of :meth:`_callmethod`:"
msgstr ":meth:`_callmethod` 的使用範例："

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2390
msgid ""
">>> l = manager.list(range(10))\n"
">>> l._callmethod('__len__')\n"
"10\n"
">>> l._callmethod('__getitem__', (slice(2, 7),)) # equivalent to l[2:7]\n"
"[2, 3, 4, 5, 6]\n"
">>> l._callmethod('__getitem__', (20,))          # equivalent to l[20]\n"
"Traceback (most recent call last):\n"
"...\n"
"IndexError: list index out of range"
msgstr ""
">>> l = manager.list(range(10))\n"
">>> l._callmethod('__len__')\n"
"10\n"
">>> l._callmethod('__getitem__', (slice(2, 7),)) # 等價於 l[2:7]\n"
"[2, 3, 4, 5, 6]\n"
">>> l._callmethod('__getitem__', (20,))          # 等價於 l[20]\n"
"Traceback (most recent call last):\n"
"...\n"
"IndexError: list index out of range"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2404
msgid "Return a copy of the referent."
msgstr "回傳參照目標的副本。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2406
msgid "If the referent is unpicklable then this will raise an exception."
msgstr "如果參照目標無法被封裝，則會引發例外。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2410
msgid "Return a representation of the proxy object."
msgstr "回傳代理物件的表示法。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2414
msgid "Return the representation of the referent."
msgstr "回傳參照目標的表示法。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2418
msgid "Cleanup"
msgstr "清理"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2420
msgid ""
"A proxy object uses a weakref callback so that when it gets garbage "
"collected it deregisters itself from the manager which owns its referent."
msgstr ""
"代理物件使用弱參照回呼，因此當它被垃圾回收時，會從擁有其參照目標的管理器中取"
"消註冊自己。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2423
msgid ""
"A shared object gets deleted from the manager process when there are no "
"longer any proxies referring to it."
msgstr ""
"當不再有任何代理物件參照某個共享物件時，該共享物件就會從管理器行程中刪除。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2428
msgid "Process Pools"
msgstr "行程池"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2433
msgid ""
"One can create a pool of processes which will carry out tasks submitted to "
"it with the :class:`Pool` class."
msgstr "可以使用 :class:`Pool` 類別建立一個行程池，由它執行提交給它的任務。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2438
msgid ""
"A process pool object which controls a pool of worker processes to which "
"jobs can be submitted.  It supports asynchronous results with timeouts and "
"callbacks and has a parallel map implementation."
msgstr ""
"一個行程池物件，控制一個可以提交作業的工作行程池。它支援帶有超時和回呼的非同"
"步結果，並具有平行的 map 實作。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2442
msgid ""
"*processes* is the number of worker processes to use.  If *processes* is "
"``None`` then the number returned by :func:`os.process_cpu_count` is used."
msgstr ""
"*processes* 是要使用的工作行程數量。如果 *processes* 為 ``None``，則會使"
"用 :func:`os.process_cpu_count` 回傳的數字。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2445
#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3022
msgid ""
"If *initializer* is not ``None`` then each worker process will call "
"``initializer(*initargs)`` when it starts."
msgstr ""
"如果 *initializer* 不是 ``None``，則每個工作行程在啟動時都會呼叫 "
"``initializer(*initargs)``。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2448
msgid ""
"*maxtasksperchild* is the number of tasks a worker process can complete "
"before it will exit and be replaced with a fresh worker process, to enable "
"unused resources to be freed. The default *maxtasksperchild* is ``None``, "
"which means worker processes will live as long as the pool."
msgstr ""
"*maxtasksperchild* 是一個工作行程在結束並被新的工作行程取代之前可以完成的任務"
"數量，目的是讓未使用的資源得以被釋放。預設的 *maxtasksperchild* 為 ``None``，"
"表示工作行程的存活時間將與池一樣長。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2453
msgid ""
"*context* can be used to specify the context used for starting the worker "
"processes.  Usually a pool is created using the "
"function :func:`multiprocessing.Pool` or the :meth:`Pool` method of a "
"context object.  In both cases *context* is set appropriately. If ``None``, "
"calling this function will have the side effect of setting the current "
"global start method if it has not been set already. See "
"the :func:`get_context` function."
msgstr ""
"*context* 可用於指定啟動工作行程時所使用的情境。通常會使"
"用 :func:`multiprocessing.Pool` 函式或情境物件的 :meth:`Pool` 方法來建立池。"
"在這兩種情況下，*context* 都會被適當地設定。如果為 ``None``，呼叫此函式會有一"
"個副作用：若目前的全域啟動方法尚未設定，則會設定它。請參"
"閱 :func:`get_context` 函式。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2461
msgid ""
"Note that the methods of the pool object should only be called by the "
"process which created the pool."
msgstr "請注意，池物件的方法只應由建立該池的行程呼叫。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2465
msgid ""
":class:`~multiprocessing.pool.Pool` objects have internal resources that "
"need to be properly managed (like any other resource) by using the pool as a "
"context manager or by calling :meth:`close` and :meth:`terminate` manually. "
"Failure to do this can lead to the process hanging on finalization."
msgstr ""
":class:`~multiprocessing.pool.Pool` 物件具有需要被適當管理的內部資源（就像任"
"何其他資源一樣），方法是將池作為情境管理器使用，或手動呼叫 :meth:`close` "
"和 :meth:`terminate`。若未這麼做，可能會導致行程在最終化時卡住。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2471
msgid ""
"Note that it is **not correct** to rely on the garbage collector to destroy "
"the pool as CPython does not assure that the finalizer of the pool will be "
"called (see :meth:`object.__del__` for more information)."
msgstr ""
"請注意，依賴垃圾回收器來銷毀池是\\ **不正確**\\ 的，因為 CPython 不保證池的最"
"終化器會被呼叫（更多資訊請參閱 :meth:`object.__del__`）。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2475
msgid "Added the *maxtasksperchild* parameter."
msgstr "新增 *maxtasksperchild*  參數。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2478
msgid "Added the *context* parameter."
msgstr "新增 *context* 參數。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2481
msgid ""
"*processes* uses :func:`os.process_cpu_count` by default, instead "
"of :func:`os.cpu_count`."
msgstr ""
"*processes* 預設使用 :func:`os.process_cpu_count`，而不"
"是 :func:`os.cpu_count`。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2487
msgid ""
"Worker processes within a :class:`Pool` typically live for the complete "
"duration of the Pool's work queue. A frequent pattern found in other systems "
"(such as Apache, mod_wsgi, etc) to free resources held by workers is to "
"allow a worker within a pool to complete only a set amount of work before "
"exiting, being cleaned up and a new process spawned to replace the old one. "
"The *maxtasksperchild* argument to the :class:`Pool` exposes this ability to "
"the end user."
msgstr ""
":class:`Pool` 中的工作行程通常會在池的工作佇列存續的整段期間都持續存活。在其"
"他系統（例如 Apache、mod_wsgi 等）中，釋放工作行程所持有資源的一種常見模式，"
"是讓池中的工作行程只完成一定數量的工作就結束，接著被清理，並衍生一個新的行程"
"來取代舊的行程。:class:`Pool` 的 *maxtasksperchild* 引數將此能力開放給終端使"
"用者。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2497
msgid ""
"Call *func* with arguments *args* and keyword arguments *kwds*.  It blocks "
"until the result is ready. Given this blocks, :meth:`apply_async` is better "
"suited for performing work in parallel. Additionally, *func* is only "
"executed in one of the workers of the pool."
msgstr ""
"以引數 *args* 和關鍵字引數 *kwds* 呼叫 *func*。它會阻塞直到結果就緒。由於它會"
"阻塞，:meth:`apply_async` 更適合用來平行地執行工作。此外，*func* 只會在池中的"
"某一個工作行程中執行。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2504
msgid ""
"A variant of the :meth:`apply` method which returns "
"a :class:`~multiprocessing.pool.AsyncResult` object."
msgstr ""
":meth:`apply` 方法的變體，會回傳一"
"個 :class:`~multiprocessing.pool.AsyncResult` 物件。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2507
#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2538
msgid ""
"If *callback* is specified then it should be a callable which accepts a "
"single argument.  When the result becomes ready *callback* is applied to it, "
"that is unless the call failed, in which case the *error_callback* is "
"applied instead."
msgstr ""
"如果有指定 *callback*，它應該是一個接受單一引數的可呼叫物件。當結果就緒時，"
"*callback* 會被套用到結果上；但若該呼叫失敗，則改為套用 *error_callback*。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2512
#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2543
msgid ""
"If *error_callback* is specified then it should be a callable which accepts "
"a single argument.  If the target function fails, then the *error_callback* "
"is called with the exception instance."
msgstr ""
"如果有指定 *error_callback*，它應該是一個接受單一引數的可呼叫物件。如果目標函"
"式失敗，則會以該例外實例呼叫 *error_callback*。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2516
#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2547
msgid ""
"Callbacks should complete immediately since otherwise the thread which "
"handles the results will get blocked."
msgstr "回呼應該立即完成，否則處理結果的執行緒會被阻塞。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2521
msgid ""
"A parallel equivalent of the :func:`map` built-in function (it supports only "
"one *iterable* argument though, for multiple iterables see :meth:`starmap`). "
"It blocks until the result is ready."
msgstr ""
"內建函式 :func:`map` 的平行版本（不過它只支援一個 *iterable* 引數，若有多個可"
"疊代物件請參閱 :meth:`starmap`）。它會阻塞直到結果就緒。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2525
msgid ""
"This method chops the iterable into a number of chunks which it submits to "
"the process pool as separate tasks.  The (approximate) size of these chunks "
"can be specified by setting *chunksize* to a positive integer."
msgstr ""
"此方法會將可疊代物件切成多個區塊，並將它們作為個別的任務提交給行程池。這些區"
"塊的（近似）大小可以透過將 *chunksize* 設為正整數來指定。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2529
msgid ""
"Note that it may cause high memory usage for very long iterables. Consider "
"using :meth:`imap` or :meth:`imap_unordered` with explicit *chunksize* "
"option for better efficiency."
msgstr ""
"請注意，對於非常長的可疊代物件，這可能會造成很高的記憶體用量。為了更好的效"
"率，可以考慮使用 :meth:`imap` 或 :meth:`imap_unordered`，並明確指定 "
"*chunksize* 選項。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2535
msgid ""
"A variant of the :meth:`.map` method which returns "
"a :class:`~multiprocessing.pool.AsyncResult` object."
msgstr ""
":meth:`.map` 方法的變體，會回傳一"
"個 :class:`~multiprocessing.pool.AsyncResult` 物件。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2552
msgid "An iterator-based version of :meth:`.map`."
msgstr "以疊代器為基礎的 :meth:`.map` 版本。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2554
msgid ""
"The *chunksize* argument is the same as the one used by the :meth:`.map` "
"method.  For very long iterables using a large value for *chunksize* can "
"make the job complete **much** faster than using the default value of ``1``."
msgstr ""
"*chunksize* 引數與 :meth:`.map` 方法所使用的相同。對於非常長的可疊代物件，"
"*chunksize* 使用較大的值可以讓作業比使用預設值 ``1`` 時完成得\\ **快很多**。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2559
msgid ""
"Also if *chunksize* is ``1`` then the :meth:`!next` method of the iterator "
"returned by the :meth:`imap` method has an optional *timeout* parameter: "
"``next(timeout)`` will raise :exc:`multiprocessing.TimeoutError` if the "
"result cannot be returned within *timeout* seconds."
msgstr ""
"此外，如果 *chunksize* 為 ``1``，則 :meth:`imap` 方法所回傳之疊代器"
"的 :meth:`!next` 方法會有一個可選的 *timeout* 參數：如果結果無法在 *timeout* "
"秒內回傳，``next(timeout)`` 會引發 :exc:`multiprocessing.TimeoutError`。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2566
msgid ""
"The same as :meth:`imap` except that the ordering of the results from the "
"returned iterator should be considered arbitrary.  (Only when there is only "
"one worker process is the order guaranteed to be \"correct\".)"
msgstr ""
"與 :meth:`imap` 相同，只不過回傳的疊代器所產生之結果的順序應被視為任意的。"
"（只有在只有一個工作行程時，順序才保證是「正確的」。）"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2572
msgid ""
"Like :meth:`~multiprocessing.pool.Pool.map` except that the elements of the "
"*iterable* are expected to be iterables that are unpacked as arguments."
msgstr ""
"類似 :meth:`~multiprocessing.pool.Pool.map`，只不過 *iterable* 的元素預期是可"
"疊代物件，並會被解包為引數。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2576
msgid ""
"Hence an *iterable* of ``[(1,2), (3, 4)]`` results in ``[func(1,2), "
"func(3,4)]``."
msgstr ""
"因此，``[(1,2), (3, 4)]`` 的 *iterable* 會產生 ``[func(1,2), func(3,4)]``。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2583
msgid ""
"A combination of :meth:`starmap` and :meth:`map_async` that iterates over "
"*iterable* of iterables and calls *func* with the iterables unpacked. "
"Returns a result object."
msgstr ""
":meth:`starmap` 和 :meth:`map_async` 的組合，會疊代由可疊代物件組成的 "
"*iterable*，並以解包後的可疊代物件呼叫 *func*。回傳一個結果物件。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2591
msgid ""
"Prevents any more tasks from being submitted to the pool.  Once all the "
"tasks have been completed the worker processes will exit."
msgstr "防止更多任務被提交到池中。一旦所有任務都完成，工作行程就會結束。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2596
msgid ""
"Stops the worker processes immediately without completing outstanding work.  "
"When the pool object is garbage collected :meth:`terminate` will be called "
"immediately."
msgstr ""
"立即停止工作行程，不完成尚未處理的工作。當池物件被垃圾回收時，會立即呼"
"叫 :meth:`terminate`。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2602
msgid ""
"Wait for the worker processes to exit.  One must call :meth:`close` "
"or :meth:`terminate` before using :meth:`join`."
msgstr ""
"等待工作行程結束。在使用 :meth:`join` 之前必須先呼叫 :meth:`close` "
"或 :meth:`terminate`。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2605
msgid ""
"Pool objects now support the context management protocol -- "
"see :ref:`typecontextmanager`.  :meth:`~contextmanager.__enter__` returns "
"the pool object, and :meth:`~contextmanager.__exit__` "
"calls :meth:`terminate`."
msgstr ""
"池物件現在支援情境管理協定，請參閱"
"\\ :ref:`typecontextmanager`。:meth:`~contextmanager.__enter__` 會回傳池物"
"件，而 :meth:`~contextmanager.__exit__` 會呼叫 :meth:`terminate`。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2613
msgid ""
"The class of the result returned by :meth:`Pool.apply_async` "
"and :meth:`Pool.map_async`."
msgstr ""
"由 :meth:`Pool.apply_async` 和 :meth:`Pool.map_async` 所回傳之結果的類別。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2618
msgid ""
"Return the result when it arrives.  If *timeout* is not ``None`` and the "
"result does not arrive within *timeout* seconds "
"then :exc:`multiprocessing.TimeoutError` is raised.  If the remote call "
"raised an exception then that exception will be reraised by :meth:`get`."
msgstr ""
"在結果送達時回傳它。如果 *timeout* 不是 ``None`` 且結果沒有在 *timeout* 秒內"
"送達，則會引發 :exc:`multiprocessing.TimeoutError`。如果遠端呼叫引發了例外，"
"則該例外會由 :meth:`get` 重新引發。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2625
msgid "Wait until the result is available or until *timeout* seconds pass."
msgstr "等待直到結果可用，或直到經過 *timeout* 秒。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2629
msgid "Return whether the call has completed."
msgstr "回傳該呼叫是否已完成。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2633
msgid ""
"Return whether the call completed without raising an exception.  Will "
"raise :exc:`ValueError` if the result is not ready."
msgstr ""
"回傳該呼叫是否在沒有引發例外的情況下完成。如果結果尚未就緒，則會引"
"發 :exc:`ValueError`。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2636
msgid ""
"If the result is not ready, :exc:`ValueError` is raised instead "
"of :exc:`AssertionError`."
msgstr ""
"如果結果尚未就緒，會引發 :exc:`ValueError` 而不是 :exc:`AssertionError`。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2640
msgid "The following example demonstrates the use of a pool::"
msgstr "以下範例示範了池的用法： ::"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2642
msgid ""
"from multiprocessing import Pool\n"
"import time\n"
"\n"
"def f(x):\n"
"    return x*x\n"
"\n"
"if __name__ == '__main__':\n"
"    with Pool(processes=4) as pool:         # start 4 worker processes\n"
"        result = pool.apply_async(f, (10,)) # evaluate \"f(10)\" "
"asynchronously in a single process\n"
"        print(result.get(timeout=1))        # prints \"100\" unless your "
"computer is *very* slow\n"
"\n"
"        print(pool.map(f, range(10)))       # prints \"[0, 1, 4,..., 81]\"\n"
"\n"
"        it = pool.imap(f, range(10))\n"
"        print(next(it))                     # prints \"0\"\n"
"        print(next(it))                     # prints \"1\"\n"
"        print(it.next(timeout=1))           # prints \"4\" unless your "
"computer is *very* slow\n"
"\n"
"        result = pool.apply_async(time.sleep, (10,))\n"
"        print(result.get(timeout=1))        # raises "
"multiprocessing.TimeoutError"
msgstr ""
"from multiprocessing import Pool\n"
"import time\n"
"\n"
"def f(x):\n"
"    return x*x\n"
"\n"
"if __name__ == '__main__':\n"
"    with Pool(processes=4) as pool:         # 啟動 4 個工作行程\n"
"        result = pool.apply_async(f, (10,)) # 在單一行程中非同步地對 "
"\"f(10)\" 求值\n"
"        print(result.get(timeout=1))        # 印出 \"100\"，除非你的電腦*非常"
"*慢\n"
"\n"
"        print(pool.map(f, range(10)))       # 印出 \"[0, 1, 4,..., 81]\"\n"
"\n"
"        it = pool.imap(f, range(10))\n"
"        print(next(it))                     # 印出 \"0\"\n"
"        print(next(it))                     # 印出 \"1\"\n"
"        print(it.next(timeout=1))           # 印出 \"4\"，除非你的電腦*非常*"
"慢\n"
"\n"
"        result = pool.apply_async(time.sleep, (10,))\n"
"        print(result.get(timeout=1))        # 引發 "
"multiprocessing.TimeoutError"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2667
msgid "Listeners and Clients"
msgstr "監聽器與用戶端"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2672
msgid ""
"Usually message passing between processes is done using queues or by "
"using :class:`~Connection` objects returned by :func:`~multiprocessing.Pipe`."
msgstr ""
"通常行程之間的訊息傳遞是透過佇列，或是使用 :func:`~multiprocessing.Pipe` 所回"
"傳的 :class:`~Connection` 物件來完成。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2676
msgid ""
"However, the :mod:`!multiprocessing.connection` module allows some extra "
"flexibility.  It basically gives a high level message oriented API for "
"dealing with sockets or Windows named pipes.  It also has support for "
"*digest authentication* using the :mod:`hmac` module, and for polling "
"multiple connections at the same time."
msgstr ""
"然而，:mod:`!multiprocessing.connection` 模組提供了一些額外的彈性。它基本上提"
"供了一個高階、以訊息為導向的 API，用於處理 socket 或 Windows 具名管道。它也支"
"援使用 :mod:`hmac` 模組進行\\ *摘要驗證* (digest authentication)，以及同時輪"
"詢多個連線。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2685
msgid ""
"Send a randomly generated message to the other end of the connection and "
"wait for a reply."
msgstr "傳送一則隨機產生的訊息到連線的另一端，並等待回覆。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2688
msgid ""
"If the reply matches the digest of the message using *authkey* as the key "
"then a welcome message is sent to the other end of the connection.  "
"Otherwise :exc:`~multiprocessing.AuthenticationError` is raised."
msgstr ""
"如果回覆與以 *authkey* 作為金鑰計算出的訊息摘要相符，則會傳送一則歡迎訊息到連"
"線的另一端。否則會引發 :exc:`~multiprocessing.AuthenticationError`。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2694
msgid ""
"Receive a message, calculate the digest of the message using *authkey* as "
"the key, and then send the digest back."
msgstr "接收一則訊息，以 *authkey* 作為金鑰計算該訊息的摘要，然後將摘要送回。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2697
msgid ""
"If a welcome message is not received, "
"then :exc:`~multiprocessing.AuthenticationError` is raised."
msgstr ""
"如果沒有收到歡迎訊息，則會引發 :exc:`~multiprocessing.AuthenticationError`。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2702
msgid ""
"Attempt to set up a connection to the listener which is using address "
"*address*, returning a :class:`~Connection`."
msgstr ""
"嘗試建立一個連到使用位址 *address* 之監聽器的連線，並回傳一"
"個 :class:`~Connection`。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2705
msgid ""
"The type of the connection is determined by *family* argument, but this can "
"generally be omitted since it can usually be inferred from the format of "
"*address*. (See :ref:`multiprocessing-address-formats`)"
msgstr ""
"連線的種類由 *family* 引數決定，但通常可以省略，因為它通常可以從 *address* 的"
"格式推斷出來。（請參閱\\ :ref:`multiprocessing-address-formats`）"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2709
#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2744
msgid ""
"If *authkey* is given and not ``None``, it should be a byte string and will "
"be used as the secret key for an HMAC-based authentication challenge. No "
"authentication is done if *authkey* is "
"``None``. :exc:`~multiprocessing.AuthenticationError` is raised if "
"authentication fails. See :ref:`multiprocessing-auth-keys`."
msgstr ""
"如果有給定 *authkey* 且不是 ``None``，它應該是一個位元組串，並會被用作基於 "
"HMAC 之驗證挑戰的秘密金鑰。如果 *authkey* 為 ``None``，則不會進行驗證。如果驗"
"證失敗，則會引發 :exc:`~multiprocessing.AuthenticationError`。請參閱"
"\\ :ref:`multiprocessing-auth-keys`。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2717
msgid ""
"A wrapper for a bound socket or Windows named pipe which is 'listening' for "
"connections."
msgstr ""
"一個已繫結之 socket 或 Windows 具名管道的包裝器，該 socket 或具名管道正在「監"
"聽」連線。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2720
msgid ""
"*address* is the address to be used by the bound socket or named pipe of the "
"listener object."
msgstr "*address* 是監聽器物件之已繫結 socket 或具名管道所要使用的位址。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2725
msgid ""
"If an address of '0.0.0.0' is used, the address will not be a connectable "
"end point on Windows. If you require a connectable end-point, you should use "
"'127.0.0.1'."
msgstr ""
"如果使用 '0.0.0.0' 位址，該位址在 Windows 上將不是可連線的端點。如果你需要可"
"連線的端點，應使用 '127.0.0.1'。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2729
msgid ""
"*family* is the type of socket (or named pipe) to use.  This can be one of "
"the strings ``'AF_INET'`` (for a TCP socket), ``'AF_UNIX'`` (for a Unix "
"domain socket) or ``'AF_PIPE'`` (for a Windows named pipe).  Of these only "
"the first is guaranteed to be available.  If *family* is ``None`` then the "
"family is inferred from the format of *address*.  If *address* is also "
"``None`` then a default is chosen.  This default is the family which is "
"assumed to be the fastest available.  See :ref:`multiprocessing-address-"
"formats`.  Note that if *family* is ``'AF_UNIX'`` and address is ``None`` "
"then the socket will be created in a private temporary directory created "
"using :func:`tempfile.mkdtemp`."
msgstr ""
"*family* 是要使用的 socket（或具名管道）的種類。它可以是字串 ``'AF_INET'``\\ "
"（TCP socket）、``'AF_UNIX'``\\ （Unix 域 socket）或 ``'AF_PIPE'``\\ "
"（Windows 具名管道）其中之一。其中只有第一個保證可用。如果 *family* 為 "
"``None``，則會從 *address* 的格式推斷 family。如果 *address* 也是 ``None``，"
"則會選擇一個預設值。這個預設值是被認為最快的可用 family。請參閱"
"\\ :ref:`multiprocessing-address-formats`。請注意，如果 *family* 為 "
"``'AF_UNIX'`` 且 address 為 ``None``，則 socket 會建立在一個使"
"用 :func:`tempfile.mkdtemp` 所建立的私有暫存目錄中。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2740
msgid ""
"If the listener object uses a socket then *backlog* (1 by default) is passed "
"to the :meth:`~socket.socket.listen` method of the socket once it has been "
"bound."
msgstr ""
"如果監聽器物件使用 socket，則在 socket 被繫結之後，*backlog*\\ （預設為 1）會"
"被傳遞給 socket 的 :meth:`~socket.socket.listen` 方法。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2752
msgid ""
"Accept a connection on the bound socket or named pipe of the listener object "
"and return a :class:`~Connection` object. If authentication is attempted and "
"fails, then :exc:`~multiprocessing.AuthenticationError` is raised."
msgstr ""
"在監聽器物件已繫結的 socket 或具名管道上接受一個連線，並回傳一"
"個 :class:`~Connection` 物件。如果嘗試進行驗證但失敗，則會引"
"發 :exc:`~multiprocessing.AuthenticationError`。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2759
msgid ""
"Close the bound socket or named pipe of the listener object.  This is called "
"automatically when the listener is garbage collected.  However it is "
"advisable to call it explicitly."
msgstr ""
"關閉監聽器物件已繫結的 socket 或具名管道。當監聽器被垃圾回收時會自動呼叫此方"
"法。不過建議明確地呼叫它。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2763
msgid "Listener objects have the following read-only properties:"
msgstr "監聽器物件具有以下唯讀屬性："

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2767
msgid "The address which is being used by the Listener object."
msgstr "Listener 物件正在使用的位址。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2771
msgid ""
"The address from which the last accepted connection came.  If this is "
"unavailable then it is ``None``."
msgstr "最後一個被接受之連線的來源位址。如果無法取得，則為 ``None``。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2774
msgid ""
"Listener objects now support the context management protocol -- "
"see :ref:`typecontextmanager`.  :meth:`~contextmanager.__enter__` returns "
"the listener object, and :meth:`~contextmanager.__exit__` "
"calls :meth:`close`."
msgstr ""
"監聽器物件現在支援情境管理協定，請參閱"
"\\ :ref:`typecontextmanager`。:meth:`~contextmanager.__enter__` 會回傳監聽器"
"物件，而 :meth:`~contextmanager.__exit__` 會呼叫 :meth:`close`。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2781
msgid ""
"Wait till an object in *object_list* is ready.  Returns the list of those "
"objects in *object_list* which are ready.  If *timeout* is a float then the "
"call blocks for at most that many seconds.  If *timeout* is ``None`` then it "
"will block for an unlimited period. A negative timeout is equivalent to a "
"zero timeout."
msgstr ""
"等待直到 *object_list* 中有物件就緒。回傳 *object_list* 中已就緒之物件的串"
"列。如果 *timeout* 是浮點數，則該呼叫最多會阻塞那麼多秒。如果 *timeout* 為 "
"``None``，則會無限期地阻塞。負的超時等同於零超時。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2787
msgid ""
"For both POSIX and Windows, an object can appear in *object_list* if it is"
msgstr ""
"在 POSIX 和 Windows 上，物件只要是以下其中一種，就可以出現在 *object_list* "
"中："

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2790
msgid "a readable :class:`~multiprocessing.connection.Connection` object;"
msgstr "可讀取的 :class:`~multiprocessing.connection.Connection` 物件；"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2791
msgid "a connected and readable :class:`socket.socket` object; or"
msgstr "已連線且可讀取的 :class:`socket.socket` 物件；或"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2792
msgid ""
"the :attr:`~multiprocessing.Process.sentinel` attribute of "
"a :class:`~multiprocessing.Process` object."
msgstr ""
":class:`~multiprocessing.Process` 物件"
"的 :attr:`~multiprocessing.Process.sentinel` 屬性。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2795
msgid ""
"A connection or socket object is ready when there is data available to be "
"read from it, or the other end has been closed."
msgstr ""
"當連線或 socket 物件有可供讀取的資料，或其另一端已被關閉時，該物件即為就緒。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2798
msgid ""
"**POSIX**: ``wait(object_list, timeout)`` almost equivalent "
"``select.select(object_list, [], [], timeout)``.  The difference is that, "
"if :func:`select.select` is interrupted by a signal, it can "
"raise :exc:`OSError` with an error number of ``EINTR``, whereas :func:`wait` "
"will not."
msgstr ""
"**POSIX**：``wait(object_list, timeout)`` 幾乎等同於 "
"``select.select(object_list, [], [], timeout)``。差別在於，如"
"果 :func:`select.select` 被訊號中斷，它可能會引發錯誤編號為 ``EINTR`` "
"的 :exc:`OSError`，而 :func:`wait` 則不會。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2804
msgid ""
"**Windows**: An item in *object_list* must either be an integer handle which "
"is waitable (according to the definition used by the documentation of the "
"Win32 function ``WaitForMultipleObjects()``) or it can be an object with "
"a :meth:`~io.IOBase.fileno` method which returns a socket handle or pipe "
"handle.  (Note that pipe handles and socket handles are **not** waitable "
"handles.)"
msgstr ""
"**Windows**：*object_list* 中的項目必須是可等待的整數控制代碼（依據 Win32 函"
"式 ``WaitForMultipleObjects()`` 的文件所使用的定義），或者是一個具"
"有 :meth:`~io.IOBase.fileno` 方法的物件，且該方法回傳 socket 控制代碼或管道控"
"制代碼。（請注意，管道控制代碼和 socket 控制代碼\\ **不是**\\ 可等待的控制代"
"碼。）"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2814
msgid "**Examples**"
msgstr "**範例**"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2816
msgid ""
"The following server code creates a listener which uses ``'secret "
"password'`` as an authentication key.  It then waits for a connection and "
"sends some data to the client::"
msgstr ""
"以下伺服器程式碼會建立一個使用 ``'secret password'`` 作為驗證金鑰的監聽器。接"
"著它會等待連線，並傳送一些資料給用戶端： ::"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2820
msgid ""
"from multiprocessing.connection import Listener\n"
"from array import array\n"
"\n"
"address = ('localhost', 6000)     # family is deduced to be 'AF_INET'\n"
"\n"
"with Listener(address, authkey=b'secret password') as listener:\n"
"    with listener.accept() as conn:\n"
"        print('connection accepted from', listener.last_accepted)\n"
"\n"
"        conn.send([2.25, None, 'junk', float])\n"
"\n"
"        conn.send_bytes(b'hello')\n"
"\n"
"        conn.send_bytes(array('i', [42, 1729]))"
msgstr ""
"from multiprocessing.connection import Listener\n"
"from array import array\n"
"\n"
"address = ('localhost', 6000)     # family 被推斷為 'AF_INET'\n"
"\n"
"with Listener(address, authkey=b'secret password') as listener:\n"
"    with listener.accept() as conn:\n"
"        print('connection accepted from', listener.last_accepted)\n"
"\n"
"        conn.send([2.25, None, 'junk', float])\n"
"\n"
"        conn.send_bytes(b'hello')\n"
"\n"
"        conn.send_bytes(array('i', [42, 1729]))"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2835
msgid ""
"The following code connects to the server and receives some data from the "
"server::"
msgstr "以下程式碼會連線到伺服器，並從伺服器接收一些資料： ::"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2838
msgid ""
"from multiprocessing.connection import Client\n"
"from array import array\n"
"\n"
"address = ('localhost', 6000)\n"
"\n"
"with Client(address, authkey=b'secret password') as conn:\n"
"    print(conn.recv())                  # => [2.25, None, 'junk', float]\n"
"\n"
"    print(conn.recv_bytes())            # => 'hello'\n"
"\n"
"    arr = array('i', [0, 0, 0, 0, 0])\n"
"    print(conn.recv_bytes_into(arr))    # => 8\n"
"    print(arr)                          # => array('i', [42, 1729, 0, 0, 0])"
msgstr ""
"from multiprocessing.connection import Client\n"
"from array import array\n"
"\n"
"address = ('localhost', 6000)\n"
"\n"
"with Client(address, authkey=b'secret password') as conn:\n"
"    print(conn.recv())                  # => [2.25, None, 'junk', float]\n"
"\n"
"    print(conn.recv_bytes())            # => 'hello'\n"
"\n"
"    arr = array('i', [0, 0, 0, 0, 0])\n"
"    print(conn.recv_bytes_into(arr))    # => 8\n"
"    print(arr)                          # => array('i', [42, 1729, 0, 0, 0])"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2852
msgid ""
"The following code uses :func:`~multiprocessing.connection.wait` to wait for "
"messages from multiple processes at once::"
msgstr ""
"以下程式碼使用 :func:`~multiprocessing.connection.wait` 同時等待來自多個行程"
"的訊息： ::"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2855
msgid ""
"from multiprocessing import Process, Pipe, current_process\n"
"from multiprocessing.connection import wait\n"
"\n"
"def foo(w):\n"
"    for i in range(10):\n"
"        w.send((i, current_process().name))\n"
"    w.close()\n"
"\n"
"if __name__ == '__main__':\n"
"    readers = []\n"
"\n"
"    for i in range(4):\n"
"        r, w = Pipe(duplex=False)\n"
"        readers.append(r)\n"
"        p = Process(target=foo, args=(w,))\n"
"        p.start()\n"
"        # We close the writable end of the pipe now to be sure that\n"
"        # p is the only process which owns a handle for it.  This\n"
"        # ensures that when p closes its handle for the writable end,\n"
"        # wait() will promptly report the readable end as being ready.\n"
"        w.close()\n"
"\n"
"    while readers:\n"
"        for r in wait(readers):\n"
"            try:\n"
"                msg = r.recv()\n"
"            except EOFError:\n"
"                readers.remove(r)\n"
"            else:\n"
"                print(msg)"
msgstr ""
"from multiprocessing import Process, Pipe, current_process\n"
"from multiprocessing.connection import wait\n"
"\n"
"def foo(w):\n"
"    for i in range(10):\n"
"        w.send((i, current_process().name))\n"
"    w.close()\n"
"\n"
"if __name__ == '__main__':\n"
"    readers = []\n"
"\n"
"    for i in range(4):\n"
"        r, w = Pipe(duplex=False)\n"
"        readers.append(r)\n"
"        p = Process(target=foo, args=(w,))\n"
"        p.start()\n"
"        # 現在就關閉管道的可寫入端，以確保\n"
"        # p 是唯一擁有其控制代碼的行程。這能\n"
"        # 確保當 p 關閉它對可寫入端的控制代碼時，\n"
"        # wait() 會立即回報可讀取端已就緒。\n"
"        w.close()\n"
"\n"
"    while readers:\n"
"        for r in wait(readers):\n"
"            try:\n"
"                msg = r.recv()\n"
"            except EOFError:\n"
"                readers.remove(r)\n"
"            else:\n"
"                print(msg)"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2890
msgid "Address Formats"
msgstr "位址格式"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2892
msgid ""
"An ``'AF_INET'`` address is a tuple of the form ``(hostname, port)`` where "
"*hostname* is a string and *port* is an integer."
msgstr ""
"``'AF_INET'`` 位址是一個 ``(hostname, port)`` 形式的 tuple，其中 *hostname* "
"是字串，*port* 是整數。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2895
msgid ""
"An ``'AF_UNIX'`` address is a string representing a filename on the "
"filesystem."
msgstr "``'AF_UNIX'`` 位址是一個代表檔案系統上某個檔名的字串。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2898
msgid ""
"An ``'AF_PIPE'`` address is a string of the form :samp:`r'\\\\\\\\\\\\.\\"
"\\pipe\\\\\\\\{PipeName}'`.  To use :func:`Client` to connect to a named "
"pipe on a remote computer called *ServerName* one should use an address of "
"the form :samp:`r'\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\{ServerName}\\\\pipe\\\\\\\\{PipeName}'` "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"``'AF_PIPE'`` 位址是一個 :samp:`r'\\\\\\\\\\\\.\\\\pipe\\\\\\\\{PipeName}'` "
"形式的字串。若要使用 :func:`Client` 連線到名為 *ServerName* 之遠端電腦上的具"
"名管道，則應改用 :samp:`r'\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\{ServerName}\\\\pipe\\\\\\\\"
"{PipeName}'` 形式的位址。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2903
msgid ""
"Note that any string beginning with two backslashes is assumed by default to "
"be an ``'AF_PIPE'`` address rather than an ``'AF_UNIX'`` address."
msgstr ""
"請注意，任何以兩個反斜線開頭的字串，預設都會被視為 ``'AF_PIPE'`` 位址，而不"
"是 ``'AF_UNIX'`` 位址。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2910
msgid "Authentication keys"
msgstr "驗證金鑰"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2912
msgid ""
"When one uses :meth:`Connection.recv <Connection.recv>`, the data received "
"is automatically unpickled. Unfortunately unpickling data from an untrusted "
"source is a security risk. Therefore :class:`Listener` and :func:`Client` "
"use the :mod:`hmac` module to provide digest authentication."
msgstr ""
"當使用 :meth:`Connection.recv <Connection.recv>` 時，收到的資料會自動被拆封。"
"不幸的是，拆封來自不受信任來源的資料是一種安全風險。因此 :class:`Listener` "
"和 :func:`Client` 使用 :mod:`hmac` 模組來提供摘要驗證。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2918
msgid ""
"An authentication key is a byte string which can be thought of as a "
"password: once a connection is established both ends will demand proof that "
"the other knows the authentication key.  (Demonstrating that both ends are "
"using the same key does **not** involve sending the key over the connection.)"
msgstr ""
"驗證金鑰是一個位元組串，可以把它想成是一組密碼：一旦連線建立，兩端都會要求對"
"方證明它知道該驗證金鑰。（證明兩端使用相同的金鑰\\ **不會**\\ 透過連線傳送該"
"金鑰。）"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2924
msgid ""
"If authentication is requested but no authentication key is specified then "
"the return value of ``current_process().authkey`` is used "
"(see :class:`~multiprocessing.Process`).  This value will be automatically "
"inherited by any :class:`~multiprocessing.Process` object that the current "
"process creates. This means that (by default) all processes of a multi-"
"process program will share a single authentication key which can be used "
"when setting up connections between themselves."
msgstr ""
"如果請求了驗證但沒有指定驗證金鑰，則會使用 ``current_process().authkey`` 的回"
"傳值（請參閱 :class:`~multiprocessing.Process`）。目前行程所建立的任"
"何 :class:`~multiprocessing.Process` 物件都會自動繼承這個值。這表示（預設情況"
"下）多行程程式中的所有行程都會共享同一個驗證金鑰，可在它們彼此之間建立連線時"
"使用。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2932
msgid ""
"Suitable authentication keys can also be generated by "
"using :func:`os.urandom`."
msgstr "也可以使用 :func:`os.urandom` 產生合適的驗證金鑰。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2934
msgid ""
"This authentication protects :class:`Listener` and :func:`Client` "
"connections, which are reachable by address.  It is not applied to the "
"anonymous pipes created by :func:`~multiprocessing.Pipe` or used internally "
"by :class:`~multiprocessing.Queue`. :mod:`multiprocessing` treats all local "
"processes running as the same user as trusted; on most operating systems "
"such processes can access each other's pipe file descriptors regardless.  "
"Applications that require isolation between processes of the same user must "
"arrange it at the operating-system level -- for example, by running workers "
"under a different user account or in a sandbox."
msgstr ""
"這種驗證保護的是可透過位址連上的 :class:`Listener` 和 :func:`Client` 連線。它"
"不適用於由 :func:`~multiprocessing.Pipe` 建立、或"
"由 :class:`~multiprocessing.Queue` 在內部使用的匿名管"
"道。:mod:`multiprocessing` 將所有以同一使用者身分執行的本地行程都視為可信任"
"的；在大多數作業系統上，這類行程無論如何都能存取彼此的管道檔案描述器。需要在"
"同一使用者的行程之間進行隔離的應用程式，必須在作業系統層級自行處理，例如以不"
"同的使用者帳號或在沙箱中執行工作行程。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2946
msgid "Logging"
msgstr "日誌記錄"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2948
msgid ""
"Some support for logging is available.  Note, however, that "
"the :mod:`logging` package does not use process shared locks so it is "
"possible (depending on the handler type) for messages from different "
"processes to get mixed up."
msgstr ""
"提供了一些日誌記錄的支援。不過請注意，:mod:`logging` 套件並不使用行程共享的"
"鎖，因此（取決於處理器的種類）來自不同行程的訊息可能會混在一起。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2955
msgid ""
"Returns the logger used by :mod:`!multiprocessing`.  If necessary, a new one "
"will be created."
msgstr ""
"回傳 :mod:`!multiprocessing` 所使用的記錄器。如有必要，會建立一個新的記錄器。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2958
msgid ""
"When first created the logger has level :const:`logging.NOTSET` and no "
"default handler. Messages sent to this logger will not by default propagate "
"to the root logger."
msgstr ""
"記錄器在初次建立時，其等級為 :const:`logging.NOTSET`，且沒有預設的處理器。預"
"設情況下，傳送到此記錄器的訊息不會傳播到根記錄器。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2962
msgid ""
"Note that on Windows child processes will only inherit the level of the "
"parent process's logger -- any other customization of the logger will not be "
"inherited."
msgstr ""
"請注意，在 Windows 上，子行程只會繼承父行程之記錄器的等級，記錄器的任何其他自"
"訂設定都不會被繼承。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2969
msgid ""
"This function performs a call to :func:`get_logger` but in addition to "
"returning the logger created by get_logger, it adds a handler which sends "
"output to :data:`sys.stderr` using format ``'[%(levelname)s/%(processName)s] "
"%(message)s'``. You can modify ``levelname`` of the logger by passing a "
"``level`` argument."
msgstr ""
"此函式會呼叫 :func:`get_logger`，但除了回傳由 get_logger 建立的記錄器之外，它"
"還會新增一個處理器，以 ``'[%(levelname)s/%(processName)s] %(message)s'`` 格式"
"將輸出傳送到 :data:`sys.stderr`。你可以透過傳遞 ``level`` 引數來修改記錄器的 "
"``levelname``。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2975
msgid "Below is an example session with logging turned on::"
msgstr "以下是啟用日誌記錄的範例工作階段： ::"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2977
msgid ""
">>> import multiprocessing, logging\n"
">>> logger = multiprocessing.log_to_stderr()\n"
">>> logger.setLevel(logging.INFO)\n"
">>> logger.warning('doomed')\n"
"[WARNING/MainProcess] doomed\n"
">>> m = multiprocessing.Manager()\n"
"[INFO/SyncManager-...] child process calling self.run()\n"
"[INFO/SyncManager-...] created temp directory /.../pymp-...\n"
"[INFO/SyncManager-...] manager serving at '/.../listener-...'\n"
">>> del m\n"
"[INFO/MainProcess] sending shutdown message to manager\n"
"[INFO/SyncManager-...] manager exiting with exitcode 0"
msgstr ""
">>> import multiprocessing, logging\n"
">>> logger = multiprocessing.log_to_stderr()\n"
">>> logger.setLevel(logging.INFO)\n"
">>> logger.warning('doomed')\n"
"[WARNING/MainProcess] doomed\n"
">>> m = multiprocessing.Manager()\n"
"[INFO/SyncManager-...] child process calling self.run()\n"
"[INFO/SyncManager-...] created temp directory /.../pymp-...\n"
"[INFO/SyncManager-...] manager serving at '/.../listener-...'\n"
">>> del m\n"
"[INFO/MainProcess] sending shutdown message to manager\n"
"[INFO/SyncManager-...] manager exiting with exitcode 0"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2990
msgid "For a full table of logging levels, see the :mod:`logging` module."
msgstr "如需完整的日誌記錄等級表，請參閱 :mod:`logging` 模組。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2994
msgid "The :mod:`!multiprocessing.dummy` module"
msgstr ":mod:`!multiprocessing.dummy` 模組"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:2999
msgid ""
":mod:`!multiprocessing.dummy` replicates the API of :mod:`!multiprocessing` "
"but is no more than a wrapper around the :mod:`threading` module."
msgstr ""
":mod:`!multiprocessing.dummy` 複製了 :mod:`!multiprocessing` 的 API，但它只不"
"過是 :mod:`threading` 模組的包裝器。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3004
msgid ""
"In particular, the ``Pool`` function provided by :mod:`!"
"multiprocessing.dummy` returns an instance of :class:`ThreadPool`, which is "
"a subclass of :class:`Pool` that supports all the same method calls but uses "
"a pool of worker threads rather than worker processes."
msgstr ""
"特別是，:mod:`!multiprocessing.dummy` 所提供的 ``Pool`` 函式會回傳一"
"個 :class:`ThreadPool` 實例，它是 :class:`Pool` 的子類別，支援所有相同的方法"
"呼叫，但使用的是工作執行緒池而不是工作行程池。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3012
msgid ""
"A thread pool object which controls a pool of worker threads to which jobs "
"can be submitted.  :class:`ThreadPool` instances are fully interface "
"compatible with :class:`Pool` instances, and their resources must also be "
"properly managed, either by using the pool as a context manager or by "
"calling :meth:`~multiprocessing.pool.Pool.close` "
"and :meth:`~multiprocessing.pool.Pool.terminate` manually."
msgstr ""
"一個執行緒池物件，控制一個可以提交作業的工作執行緒池。:class:`ThreadPool` 實"
"例與 :class:`Pool` 實例的介面完全相容，而且其資源也必須被適當地管理，方法是將"
"池作為情境管理器使用，或手動呼叫 :meth:`~multiprocessing.pool.Pool.close` "
"和 :meth:`~multiprocessing.pool.Pool.terminate`。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3019
msgid ""
"*processes* is the number of worker threads to use.  If *processes* is "
"``None`` then the number returned by :func:`os.process_cpu_count` is used."
msgstr ""
"*processes* 是要使用的工作執行緒數量。如果 *processes* 為 ``None``，則會使"
"用 :func:`os.process_cpu_count` 回傳的數字。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3025
msgid ""
"Unlike :class:`Pool`, *maxtasksperchild* and *context* cannot be provided."
msgstr "與 :class:`Pool` 不同，無法提供 *maxtasksperchild* 和 *context*。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3029
msgid ""
"A :class:`ThreadPool` shares the same interface as :class:`Pool`, which is "
"designed around a pool of processes and predates the introduction of "
"the :class:`concurrent.futures` module.  As such, it inherits some "
"operations that don't make sense for a pool backed by threads, and it has "
"its own type for representing the status of asynchronous "
"jobs, :class:`AsyncResult`, that is not understood by any other libraries."
msgstr ""
":class:`ThreadPool` 與 :class:`Pool` 共用相同的介面，而後者是圍繞著行程池所設"
"計的，且早於 :class:`concurrent.futures` 模組的引入。因此，它繼承了一些對以執"
"行緒為基礎的池而言沒有意義的操作，而且它有自己用來表示非同步作業狀態的型"
"別 :class:`AsyncResult`，其他函式庫都無法理解這個型別。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3036
msgid ""
"Users should generally prefer to "
"use :class:`concurrent.futures.ThreadPoolExecutor`, which has a simpler "
"interface that was designed around threads from the start, and which "
"returns :class:`concurrent.futures.Future` instances that are compatible "
"with many other libraries, including :mod:`asyncio`."
msgstr ""
"使用者通常應優先使用 :class:`concurrent.futures.ThreadPoolExecutor`，它具有從"
"一開始就圍繞執行緒設計的更簡單介面，並且會回傳與許多其他函式庫（包"
"括 :mod:`asyncio`）相容的 :class:`concurrent.futures.Future` 實例。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3046
msgid "Programming guidelines"
msgstr "程式設計指引"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3048
msgid ""
"There are certain guidelines and idioms which should be adhered to when "
"using :mod:`!multiprocessing`."
msgstr "使用 :mod:`!multiprocessing` 時，應遵守一些特定的指引和慣用寫法。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3053
msgid "All start methods"
msgstr "所有啟動方法"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3055
msgid "The following applies to all start methods."
msgstr "以下內容適用於所有啟動方法。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3057
msgid "Avoid shared state"
msgstr "避免共享狀態"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3059
msgid ""
"As far as possible one should try to avoid shifting large amounts of data "
"between processes."
msgstr "應盡可能避免在行程之間轉移大量資料。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3062
msgid ""
"It is probably best to stick to using queues or pipes for communication "
"between processes rather than using the lower level synchronization "
"primitives."
msgstr "行程之間的通訊或許最好堅持使用佇列或管道，而不是使用較低階的同步原語。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3066
msgid "Picklability"
msgstr "可封裝性"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3068
msgid "Ensure that the arguments to the methods of proxies are picklable."
msgstr "確保代理物件之方法的引數都是可封裝的。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3070
msgid "Thread safety of proxies"
msgstr "代理物件的執行緒安全"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3072
msgid ""
"Do not use a proxy object from more than one thread unless you protect it "
"with a lock."
msgstr "除非使用鎖來保護，否則不要在多個執行緒中使用同一個代理物件。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3075
msgid ""
"(There is never a problem with different processes using the *same* proxy.)"
msgstr "（不同行程使用\\ *同一個*\\ 代理物件則永遠不會有問題。）"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3077
msgid "Joining zombie processes"
msgstr "對殭屍行程 (zombie process) 進行 join"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3079
msgid ""
"On POSIX when a process finishes but has not been joined it becomes a "
"zombie. There should never be very many because each time a new process "
"starts (or :func:`~multiprocessing.active_children` is called) all completed "
"processes which have not yet been joined will be joined.  Also calling a "
"finished process's :meth:`Process.is_alive "
"<multiprocessing.Process.is_alive>` will join the process.  Even so it is "
"probably good practice to explicitly join all the processes that you start."
msgstr ""
"在 POSIX 上，當一個行程結束但尚未被 join 時，它會變成殭屍行程。殭屍行程應該永"
"遠不會太多，因為每當有新行程啟動（或呼"
"叫 :func:`~multiprocessing.active_children`）時，所有已完成但尚未被 join 的行"
"程都會被 join。此外，呼叫已結束行程的 :meth:`Process.is_alive "
"<multiprocessing.Process.is_alive>` 也會 join 該行程。即便如此，明確地 join "
"所有你啟動的行程可能仍是良好的做法。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3087
msgid "Better to inherit than pickle/unpickle"
msgstr "繼承比封裝／拆封更好"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3089
msgid ""
"When using the *spawn* or *forkserver* start methods many types from :mod:`!"
"multiprocessing` need to be picklable so that child processes can use them.  "
"However, one should generally avoid sending shared objects to other "
"processes using pipes or queues. Instead you should arrange the program so "
"that a process which needs access to a shared resource created elsewhere can "
"inherit it from an ancestor process."
msgstr ""
"使用 *spawn* 或 *forkserver* 啟動方法時，:mod:`!multiprocessing` 中的許多型別"
"都需要是可封裝的，以便子行程可以使用它們。然而，一般來說應避免使用管道或佇列"
"將共享物件傳送給其他行程。相反地，你應該安排程式，讓需要存取在別處建立之共享"
"資源的行程，可以從祖先行程繼承該資源。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3097
msgid "Avoid terminating processes"
msgstr "避免終止行程"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3099
msgid ""
"Using the :meth:`Process.terminate <multiprocessing.Process.terminate>` "
"method to stop a process is liable to cause any shared resources (such as "
"locks, semaphores, pipes and queues) currently being used by the process to "
"become broken or unavailable to other processes."
msgstr ""
"使用 :meth:`Process.terminate <multiprocessing.Process.terminate>` 方法來停止"
"行程，可能會導致該行程目前正在使用的任何共享資源（例如鎖、號誌、管道和佇列）"
"損壞，或無法被其他行程使用。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3105
msgid ""
"Therefore it is probably best to only consider "
"using :meth:`Process.terminate <multiprocessing.Process.terminate>` on "
"processes which never use any shared resources."
msgstr ""
"因此，或許最好只考慮對從不使用任何共享資源的行程使"
"用 :meth:`Process.terminate <multiprocessing.Process.terminate>`。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3109
msgid "Joining processes that use queues"
msgstr "對使用佇列的行程進行 join"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3111
msgid ""
"Bear in mind that a process that has put items in a queue will wait before "
"terminating until all the buffered items are fed by the \"feeder\" thread to "
"the underlying pipe.  (The child process can call "
"the :meth:`Queue.cancel_join_thread "
"<multiprocessing.Queue.cancel_join_thread>` method of the queue to avoid "
"this behaviour.)"
msgstr ""
"請記住，已將項目放入佇列的行程在終止之前會等待，直到所有緩衝的項目都已由「饋"
"送」執行緒送入底層的管道為止。（子行程可以呼叫佇列"
"的 :meth:`Queue.cancel_join_thread "
"<multiprocessing.Queue.cancel_join_thread>` 方法來避免這種行為。）"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3117
msgid ""
"This means that whenever you use a queue you need to make sure that all "
"items which have been put on the queue will eventually be removed before the "
"process is joined.  Otherwise you cannot be sure that processes which have "
"put items on the queue will terminate.  Remember also that non-daemonic "
"processes will be joined automatically."
msgstr ""
"這表示每當你使用佇列時，都需要確保所有已放入佇列的項目最終都會在該行程被 "
"join 之前被移除。否則你無法確定已將項目放入佇列的行程會終止。另外也請記住，非"
"常駐行程會自動被 join。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3123
msgid "An example which will deadlock is the following::"
msgstr "以下是一個會發生死鎖的範例： ::"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3125
msgid ""
"from multiprocessing import Process, Queue\n"
"\n"
"def f(q):\n"
"    q.put('X' * 1000000)\n"
"\n"
"if __name__ == '__main__':\n"
"    queue = Queue()\n"
"    p = Process(target=f, args=(queue,))\n"
"    p.start()\n"
"    p.join()                    # this deadlocks\n"
"    obj = queue.get()"
msgstr ""
"from multiprocessing import Process, Queue\n"
"\n"
"def f(q):\n"
"    q.put('X' * 1000000)\n"
"\n"
"if __name__ == '__main__':\n"
"    queue = Queue()\n"
"    p = Process(target=f, args=(queue,))\n"
"    p.start()\n"
"    p.join()                    # 這會發生死鎖\n"
"    obj = queue.get()"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3137
msgid ""
"A fix here would be to swap the last two lines (or simply remove the "
"``p.join()`` line)."
msgstr "這裡的修正方法是交換最後兩行（或直接移除 ``p.join()`` 這一行）。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3140
msgid "Explicitly pass resources to child processes"
msgstr "明確地將資源傳遞給子行程"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3142
msgid ""
"On POSIX using the *fork* start method, a child process can make use of a "
"shared resource created in a parent process using a global resource.  "
"However, it is better to pass the object as an argument to the constructor "
"for the child process."
msgstr ""
"在 POSIX 上使用 *fork* 啟動方法時，子行程可以透過全域資源使用在父行程中建立的"
"共享資源。然而，最好還是將該物件作為引數傳遞給子行程的建構函式。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3147
msgid ""
"Apart from making the code (potentially) compatible with Windows and the "
"other start methods this also ensures that as long as the child process is "
"still alive the object will not be garbage collected in the parent process.  "
"This might be important if some resource is freed when the object is garbage "
"collected in the parent process."
msgstr ""
"除了讓程式碼（可能）與 Windows 及其他啟動方法相容之外，這也確保只要子行程仍然"
"存活，該物件就不會在父行程中被垃圾回收。如果在父行程中物件被垃圾回收時會釋放"
"某些資源，這一點可能很重要。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3154
msgid "So for instance ::"
msgstr "所以舉例來說 ::"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3156
msgid ""
"from multiprocessing import Process, Lock\n"
"\n"
"def f():\n"
"    ... do something using \"lock\" ...\n"
"\n"
"if __name__ == '__main__':\n"
"    lock = Lock()\n"
"    for i in range(10):\n"
"        Process(target=f).start()"
msgstr ""
"from multiprocessing import Process, Lock\n"
"\n"
"def f():\n"
"    ... do something using \"lock\" ...\n"
"\n"
"if __name__ == '__main__':\n"
"    lock = Lock()\n"
"    for i in range(10):\n"
"        Process(target=f).start()"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3166
msgid "should be rewritten as ::"
msgstr "應該改寫為 ::"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3168
msgid ""
"from multiprocessing import Process, Lock\n"
"\n"
"def f(l):\n"
"    ... do something using \"l\" ...\n"
"\n"
"if __name__ == '__main__':\n"
"    lock = Lock()\n"
"    for i in range(10):\n"
"        Process(target=f, args=(lock,)).start()"
msgstr ""
"from multiprocessing import Process, Lock\n"
"\n"
"def f(l):\n"
"    ... do something using \"l\" ...\n"
"\n"
"if __name__ == '__main__':\n"
"    lock = Lock()\n"
"    for i in range(10):\n"
"        Process(target=f, args=(lock,)).start()"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3178
msgid "Beware of replacing :data:`sys.stdin` with a \"file like object\""
msgstr "當心以「類檔案物件」取代 :data:`sys.stdin`"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3180
msgid ":mod:`!multiprocessing` originally unconditionally called::"
msgstr ":mod:`!multiprocessing` 原本會無條件地呼叫： ::"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3182
msgid "os.close(sys.stdin.fileno())"
msgstr "os.close(sys.stdin.fileno())"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3184
msgid ""
"in the :meth:`multiprocessing.Process._bootstrap` method --- this resulted "
"in issues with processes-in-processes. This has been changed to::"
msgstr ""
"這段程式碼位於 :meth:`multiprocessing.Process._bootstrap` 方法中 --- 這導致了"
"行程中的行程 (processes-in-processes) 的問題。這已被改為： ::"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3187
msgid ""
"sys.stdin.close()\n"
"sys.stdin = open(os.open(os.devnull, os.O_RDONLY), closefd=False)"
msgstr ""
"sys.stdin.close()\n"
"sys.stdin = open(os.open(os.devnull, os.O_RDONLY), closefd=False)"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3190
msgid ""
"Which solves the fundamental issue of processes colliding with each other "
"resulting in a bad file descriptor error, but introduces a potential danger "
"to applications which replace :func:`sys.stdin` with a \"file-like object\" "
"with output buffering.  This danger is that if multiple processes "
"call :meth:`~io.IOBase.close` on this file-like object, it could result in "
"the same data being flushed to the object multiple times, resulting in "
"corruption."
msgstr ""
"這解決了行程之間互相衝突而導致檔案描述器錯誤 (bad file descriptor error) 的根"
"本問題，但對於以具有輸出緩衝功能的「類檔案物件」取代 :func:`sys.stdin` 的應用"
"程式，則帶來了潛在的危險。這個危險是，如果多個行程對此類檔案物件呼"
"叫 :meth:`~io.IOBase.close`，可能會導致相同的資料被多次排清到該物件，進而造成"
"資料損毀。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3197
msgid ""
"If you write a file-like object and implement your own caching, you can make "
"it fork-safe by storing the pid whenever you append to the cache, and "
"discarding the cache when the pid changes. For example::"
msgstr ""
"如果你撰寫了一個類檔案物件並實作了自己的快取，可以藉由在每次附加到快取時儲存 "
"pid，並在 pid 改變時捨棄快取，讓它成為 fork 安全 (fork-safe) 的。例如： ::"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3201
msgid ""
"@property\n"
"def cache(self):\n"
"    pid = os.getpid()\n"
"    if pid != self._pid:\n"
"        self._pid = pid\n"
"        self._cache = []\n"
"    return self._cache"
msgstr ""
"@property\n"
"def cache(self):\n"
"    pid = os.getpid()\n"
"    if pid != self._pid:\n"
"        self._pid = pid\n"
"        self._cache = []\n"
"    return self._cache"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3209
msgid ""
"For more information, see :issue:`5155`, :issue:`5313` and :issue:`5331`"
msgstr "更多資訊請參閱 :issue:`5155`、:issue:`5313` 和 :issue:`5331`"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3215
msgid "The *spawn* and *forkserver* start methods"
msgstr "*spawn* 和 *forkserver* 啟動方法"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3217
msgid ""
"There are a few extra restrictions which don't apply to the *fork* start "
"method."
msgstr "以下有一些不適用於 *fork* 啟動方法的額外限制。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3220
msgid "More picklability"
msgstr "更多可封裝性要求"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3222
msgid ""
"Ensure that all arguments to :class:`~multiprocessing.Process` are "
"picklable.  Also, if you subclass ``Process.__init__``, you must make sure "
"that instances will be picklable when the :meth:`Process.start "
"<multiprocessing.Process.start>` method is called."
msgstr ""
"確保 :class:`~multiprocessing.Process` 的所有引數都是可封裝的。此外，如果你透"
"過子類別覆寫 ``Process.__init__``，則必須確保在呼叫 :meth:`Process.start "
"<multiprocessing.Process.start>` 方法時，實例是可封裝的。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3227
msgid "Global variables"
msgstr "全域變數"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3229
msgid ""
"Bear in mind that if code run in a child process tries to access a global "
"variable, then the value it sees (if any) may not be the same as the value "
"in the parent process at the time that :meth:`Process.start "
"<multiprocessing.Process.start>` was called."
msgstr ""
"請記住，如果在子行程中執行的程式碼嘗試存取全域變數，那麼它看到的值（如果有的"
"話）可能與呼叫 :meth:`Process.start <multiprocessing.Process.start>` 時父行程"
"中的值不同。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3234
msgid ""
"However, global variables which are just module level constants cause no "
"problems."
msgstr "然而，僅作為模組層級常數的全域變數不會造成問題。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3239
msgid "Safe importing of main module"
msgstr "安全地引入主模組"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3241
msgid ""
"Make sure that the main module can be safely imported by a new Python "
"interpreter without causing unintended side effects (such as starting a new "
"process)."
msgstr ""
"確保主模組可以被新的 Python 直譯器安全地引入，而不會造成意外的副作用（例如啟"
"動新的行程）。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3245
msgid ""
"For example, using the *spawn* or *forkserver* start method running the "
"following module would fail with a :exc:`RuntimeError`::"
msgstr ""
"舉例來說，使用 *spawn* 或 *forkserver* 啟動方法執行以下模組時，會"
"因 :exc:`RuntimeError` 而失敗： ::"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3249
msgid ""
"from multiprocessing import Process\n"
"\n"
"def foo():\n"
"    print('hello')\n"
"\n"
"p = Process(target=foo)\n"
"p.start()"
msgstr ""
"from multiprocessing import Process\n"
"\n"
"def foo():\n"
"    print('hello')\n"
"\n"
"p = Process(target=foo)\n"
"p.start()"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3257
msgid ""
"Instead one should protect the \"entry point\" of the program by using ``if "
"__name__ == '__main__':`` as follows::"
msgstr ""
"應改為使用 ``if __name__ == '__main__':`` 來保護程式的「進入點」，如下所"
"示： ::"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3260
msgid ""
"from multiprocessing import Process, freeze_support, set_start_method\n"
"\n"
"def foo():\n"
"    print('hello')\n"
"\n"
"if __name__ == '__main__':\n"
"    freeze_support()\n"
"    set_start_method('spawn')\n"
"    p = Process(target=foo)\n"
"    p.start()"
msgstr ""
"from multiprocessing import Process, freeze_support, set_start_method\n"
"\n"
"def foo():\n"
"    print('hello')\n"
"\n"
"if __name__ == '__main__':\n"
"    freeze_support()\n"
"    set_start_method('spawn')\n"
"    p = Process(target=foo)\n"
"    p.start()"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3271
msgid ""
"(The ``freeze_support()`` line can be omitted if the program will be run "
"normally instead of frozen.)"
msgstr ""
"（如果程式會以一般方式執行而非被凍結，則可以省略 ``freeze_support()`` 這一"
"行。）"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3274
msgid ""
"This allows the newly spawned Python interpreter to safely import the module "
"and then run the module's ``foo()`` function."
msgstr ""
"這讓新衍生的 Python 直譯器可以安全地引入該模組，然後執行模組的 ``foo()`` 函"
"式。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3277
msgid ""
"Similar restrictions apply if a pool or manager is created in the main "
"module."
msgstr "如果在主模組中建立了池或管理器，也適用類似的限制。"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3284
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "範例"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3286
msgid "Demonstration of how to create and use customized managers and proxies:"
msgstr "示範如何建立和使用自訂的管理器和代理物件："

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3288
msgid ""
"from multiprocessing import freeze_support\n"
"from multiprocessing.managers import BaseManager, BaseProxy\n"
"import operator\n"
"\n"
"##\n"
"\n"
"class Foo:\n"
"    def f(self):\n"
"        print('you called Foo.f()')\n"
"    def g(self):\n"
"        print('you called Foo.g()')\n"
"    def _h(self):\n"
"        print('you called Foo._h()')\n"
"\n"
"# A simple generator function\n"
"def baz():\n"
"    for i in range(10):\n"
"        yield i*i\n"
"\n"
"# Proxy type for generator objects\n"
"class GeneratorProxy(BaseProxy):\n"
"    _exposed_ = ['__next__']\n"
"    def __iter__(self):\n"
"        return self\n"
"    def __next__(self):\n"
"        return self._callmethod('__next__')\n"
"\n"
"# Function to return the operator module\n"
"def get_operator_module():\n"
"    return operator\n"
"\n"
"##\n"
"\n"
"class MyManager(BaseManager):\n"
"    pass\n"
"\n"
"# register the Foo class; make `f()` and `g()` accessible via proxy\n"
"MyManager.register('Foo1', Foo)\n"
"\n"
"# register the Foo class; make `g()` and `_h()` accessible via proxy\n"
"MyManager.register('Foo2', Foo, exposed=('g', '_h'))\n"
"\n"
"# register the generator function baz; use `GeneratorProxy` to make proxies\n"
"MyManager.register('baz', baz, proxytype=GeneratorProxy)\n"
"\n"
"# register get_operator_module(); make public functions accessible via "
"proxy\n"
"MyManager.register('operator', get_operator_module)\n"
"\n"
"##\n"
"\n"
"def test():\n"
"    manager = MyManager()\n"
"    manager.start()\n"
"\n"
"    print('-' * 20)\n"
"\n"
"    f1 = manager.Foo1()\n"
"    f1.f()\n"
"    f1.g()\n"
"    assert not hasattr(f1, '_h')\n"
"    assert sorted(f1._exposed_) == sorted(['f', 'g'])\n"
"\n"
"    print('-' * 20)\n"
"\n"
"    f2 = manager.Foo2()\n"
"    f2.g()\n"
"    f2._h()\n"
"    assert not hasattr(f2, 'f')\n"
"    assert sorted(f2._exposed_) == sorted(['g', '_h'])\n"
"\n"
"    print('-' * 20)\n"
"\n"
"    it = manager.baz()\n"
"    for i in it:\n"
"        print('<%d>' % i, end=' ')\n"
"    print()\n"
"\n"
"    print('-' * 20)\n"
"\n"
"    op = manager.operator()\n"
"    print('op.add(23, 45) =', op.add(23, 45))\n"
"    print('op.pow(2, 94) =', op.pow(2, 94))\n"
"    print('op._exposed_ =', op._exposed_)\n"
"\n"
"##\n"
"\n"
"if __name__ == '__main__':\n"
"    freeze_support()\n"
"    test()\n"
msgstr ""
"from multiprocessing import freeze_support\n"
"from multiprocessing.managers import BaseManager, BaseProxy\n"
"import operator\n"
"\n"
"##\n"
"\n"
"class Foo:\n"
"    def f(self):\n"
"        print('you called Foo.f()')\n"
"    def g(self):\n"
"        print('you called Foo.g()')\n"
"    def _h(self):\n"
"        print('you called Foo._h()')\n"
"\n"
"# 一個簡單的產生器函式\n"
"def baz():\n"
"    for i in range(10):\n"
"        yield i*i\n"
"\n"
"# 產生器物件的代理型別\n"
"class GeneratorProxy(BaseProxy):\n"
"    _exposed_ = ['__next__']\n"
"    def __iter__(self):\n"
"        return self\n"
"    def __next__(self):\n"
"        return self._callmethod('__next__')\n"
"\n"
"# 回傳 operator 模組的函式\n"
"def get_operator_module():\n"
"    return operator\n"
"\n"
"##\n"
"\n"
"class MyManager(BaseManager):\n"
"    pass\n"
"\n"
"# 註冊 Foo 類別；讓 f() 和 g() 可透過代理物件存取\n"
"MyManager.register('Foo1', Foo)\n"
"\n"
"# 註冊 Foo 類別；讓 g() 和 _h() 可透過代理物件存取\n"
"MyManager.register('Foo2', Foo, exposed=('g', '_h'))\n"
"\n"
"# 註冊產生器函式 baz；使用 GeneratorProxy 來建立代理物件\n"
"MyManager.register('baz', baz, proxytype=GeneratorProxy)\n"
"\n"
"# 註冊 get_operator_module()；讓公開函式可透過代理物件存取\n"
"MyManager.register('operator', get_operator_module)\n"
"\n"
"##\n"
"\n"
"def test():\n"
"    manager = MyManager()\n"
"    manager.start()\n"
"\n"
"    print('-' * 20)\n"
"\n"
"    f1 = manager.Foo1()\n"
"    f1.f()\n"
"    f1.g()\n"
"    assert not hasattr(f1, '_h')\n"
"    assert sorted(f1._exposed_) == sorted(['f', 'g'])\n"
"\n"
"    print('-' * 20)\n"
"\n"
"    f2 = manager.Foo2()\n"
"    f2.g()\n"
"    f2._h()\n"
"    assert not hasattr(f2, 'f')\n"
"    assert sorted(f2._exposed_) == sorted(['g', '_h'])\n"
"\n"
"    print('-' * 20)\n"
"\n"
"    it = manager.baz()\n"
"    for i in it:\n"
"        print('<%d>' % i, end=' ')\n"
"    print()\n"
"\n"
"    print('-' * 20)\n"
"\n"
"    op = manager.operator()\n"
"    print('op.add(23, 45) =', op.add(23, 45))\n"
"    print('op.pow(2, 94) =', op.pow(2, 94))\n"
"    print('op._exposed_ =', op._exposed_)\n"
"\n"
"##\n"
"\n"
"if __name__ == '__main__':\n"
"    freeze_support()\n"
"    test()\n"

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3292
msgid "Using :class:`~multiprocessing.pool.Pool`:"
msgstr "使用 :class:`~multiprocessing.pool.Pool`："

#: ../../library/multiprocessing.rst:3294
msgid ""
"import multiprocessing\n"
"import time\n"
"import random\n"
"import sys\n"
"\n"
"#\n"
"# Functions used by test code\n"
"#\n"
"\n"
"def calculate(func, args):\n"
"    result = func(*args)\n"
"    return '%s says that %s%s = %s' % (\n"
"        multiprocessing.current_process().name,\n"
"        func.__name__, args, result\n"
"        )\n"
"\n"
"def calculatestar(args):\n"
"    return calculate(*args)\n"
"\n"
"def mul(a, b):\n"
"    time.sleep(0.5 * random.random())\n"
"    return a * b\n"
"\n"
"def plus(a, b):\n"
"    time.sleep(0.5 * random.random())\n"
"    return a + b\n"
"\n"
"def f(x):\n"
"    return 1.0 / (x - 5.0)\n"
"\n"
"def pow3(x):\n"
"    return x ** 3\n"
"\n"
"def noop(x):\n"
"    pass\n"
"\n"
"#\n"
"# Test code\n"
"#\n"
"\n"
"def test():\n"
"    PROCESSES = 4\n"
"    print('Creating pool with %d processes\\n' % PROCESSES)\n"
"\n"
"    with multiprocessing.Pool(PROCESSES) as pool:\n"
"        #\n"
"        # Tests\n"
"        #\n"
"\n"
"        TASKS = [(mul, (i, 7)) for i in range(10)] + \\\n"
"                [(plus, (i, 8)) for i in range(10)]\n"
"\n"
"        results = [pool.apply_async(calculate, t) for t in TASKS]\n"
"        imap_it = pool.imap(calculatestar, TASKS)\n"
"        imap_unordered_it = pool.imap_unordered(calculatestar, TASKS)\n"
"\n"
"        print('Ordered results using pool.apply_async():')\n"
"        for r in results:\n"
"            print('\\t', r.get())\n"
"        print()\n"
"\n"
"        print('Ordered results using pool.imap():')\n"
"        for x in imap_it:\n"
"            print('\\t', x)\n"
"        print()\n"
"\n"
"        print('Unordered results using pool.imap_unordered():')\n"
"        for x in imap_unordered_it:\n"
"            print('\\t', x)\n"
"        print()\n"
"\n"
"        print('Ordered results using pool.map() --- will block till "
"complete:')\n"
"        for x in pool.map(calculatestar, TASKS):\n"
"            print('\\t', x)\n"
"        print()\n"
"\n"
"        #\n"
"        # Test error handling\n"
"        #\n"
"\n"
"        print('Testing error handling:')\n"
"\n"
"        try:\n"
"            print(pool.apply(f, (5,)))\n"
"        except ZeroDivisionError:\n"
"            print('\\tGot ZeroDivisionError as expected from pool.apply()')\n"
"        else:\n"
"            raise AssertionError('expected ZeroDivisionError')\n"
"\n"
"        try:\n"
"            print(pool.map(f, list(range(10))))\n"
"        except ZeroDivisionError:\n"
"            print('\\tGot ZeroDivisionError as expected from pool.map()')\n"
"        else:\n"
"            raise AssertionError('expected ZeroDivisionError')\n"
"\n"
"        try:\n"
"            print(list(pool.imap(f, list(range(10)))))\n"
"        except ZeroDivisionError:\n"
"            print('\\tGot ZeroDivisionError as expected from "
"list(pool.imap())')\n"
"        else:\n"
"            raise AssertionError('expected ZeroDivisionError')\n"
"\n"
"        it = pool.imap(f, list(range(10)))\n"
"        for i in range(10):\n"
"            try:\n"
"                x = next(it)\n"
"            except ZeroDivisionError:\n"
"                if i == 5:\n"
"                    pass\n"
"            except StopIteration:\n"
"                break\n"
"            else:\n"
"                if i == 5:\n"
"                    raise AssertionError('expected ZeroDivisionError')\n"
"\n"
"        assert i == 9\n"
"        print('\\tGot ZeroDivisionError as expected from "
"IMapIterator.next()')\n"
"        print()\n"
"\n"
"        #\n"
"        # Testing timeouts\n"
"        #\n"
"\n"
"        print('Testing ApplyResult.get() with timeout:', end=' ')\n"
"        res = pool.apply_async(calculate, TASKS[0])\n"
"        while 1:\n"
"            sys.stdout.flush()\n"
"            try:\n"
"                sys.stdout.write('\\n\\t%s' % res.get(0.02))\n"
"                break\n"
"            except multiprocessing.TimeoutError:\n"
"                sys.stdout.write('.')\n"
"        print()\n"
"        print()\n"
"\n"
"        print('Testing IMapIterator.next() with timeout:', end=' ')\n"
"        it = pool.imap(calculatestar, TASKS)\n"
"        while 1:\n"
"            sys.stdout.flush()\n"
"            try:\n"
"                sys.stdout.write('\\n\\t%s' % it.next(0.02))\n"
"            except StopIteration:\n"
"                break\n"
"            except multiprocessing.TimeoutError:\n"
"                sys.stdout.write('.')\n"
"        print()\n"
"        print()\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"if __name__ == '__main__':\n"
"    multiprocessing.freeze_support()\n"
"    test()\n"
msgstr ""
"import multiprocessing\n"
"import time\n"
"import random\n"
"import sys\n"
"\n"
"#\n"
"# 測試程式碼所使用的函式\n"
"#\n"
"\n"
"def calculate(func, args):\n"
"    result = func(*args)\n"
"    return '%s says that %s%s = %s' % (\n"
"        multiprocessing.current_process().name,\n"
"        func.__name__, args, result\n"
"        )\n"
"\n"
"def calculatestar(args):\n"
"    return calculate(*args)\n"
"\n"
"def mul(a, b):\n"
"    time.sleep(0.5 * random.random())\n"
"    return a * b\n"
"\n"
"def plus(a, b):\n"
"    time.sleep(0.5 * random.random())\n"
"    return a + b\n"
"\n"
"def f(x):\n"
"    return 1.0 / (x - 5.0)\n"
"\n"
"def pow3(x):\n"
"    return x ** 3\n"
"\n"
"def noop(x):\n"
"    pass\n"
"\n"
"#\n"
"# 測試程式碼\n"
"#\n"
"\n"
"def test():\n"
"    PROCESSES = 4\n"
"    print('Creating pool with %d processes\\n' % PROCESSES)\n"
"\n"
"    with multiprocessing.Pool(PROCESSES) as pool:\n"
"        #\n"
"        # 測試\n"
"        #\n"
"\n"
"        TASKS = [(mul, (i, 7)) for i in range(10)] + \\\n"
"                [(plus, (i, 8)) for i in range(10)]\n"
"\n"
"        results = [pool.apply_async(calculate, t) for t in TASKS]\n"
"        imap_it = pool.imap(calculatestar, TASKS)\n"
"        imap_unordered_it = pool.imap_unordered(calculatestar, TASKS)\n"
"\n"
"        print('Ordered results using pool.apply_async():')\n"
"        for r in results:\n"
"            print('\\t', r.get())\n"
"        print()\n"
"\n"
"        print('Ordered results using pool.imap():')\n"
"        for x in imap_it:\n"
"            print('\\t', x)\n"
"        print()\n"
"\n"
"        print('Unordered results using pool.imap_unordered():')\n"
"        for x in imap_unordered_it:\n"
"            print('\\t', x)\n"
"        print()\n"
"\n"
"        print('Ordered results using pool.map() --- will block till "
"complete:')\n"
"        for x in pool.map(calculatestar, TASKS):\n"
"            print('\\t', x)\n"
"        print()\n"
"\n"
"        #\n"
"        # 測試錯誤處理\n"
"        #\n"
"\n"
"        print('Testing error handling:')\n"
"\n"
"        try:\n"
"            print(pool.apply(f, (5,)))\n"
"        except ZeroDivisionError:\n"
"            print('\\tGot ZeroDivisionError as expected from pool.apply()')\n"
"        else:\n"
"            raise AssertionError('expected ZeroDivisionError')\n"
"\n"
"        try:\n"
"            print(pool.map(f, list(range(10))))\n"
"        except ZeroDivisionError:\n"
"            print('\\tGot ZeroDivisionError as expected from pool.map()')\n"
"        else:\n"
"            raise AssertionError('expected ZeroDivisionError')\n"
"\n"
"        try:\n"
"            print(list(pool.imap(f, list(range(10)))))\n"
"        except ZeroDivisionError:\n"
"            print('\\tGot ZeroDivisionError as expected from "
"list(pool.imap())')\n"
"        else:\n"
"            raise AssertionError('expected ZeroDivisionError')\n"
"\n"
"        it = pool.imap(f, list(range(10)))\n"
"        for i in range(10):\n"
"            try:\n"
"                x = next(it)\n"
"            except ZeroDivisionError:\n"
"                if i == 5:\n"
"                    pass\n"
"            except StopIteration:\n"
"                break\n"
"            else:\n"
"                if i == 5:\n"
"                    raise AssertionError('expected ZeroDivisionError')\n"
"\n"
"        assert i == 9\n"
"        print('\\tGot ZeroDivisionError as expected from "
"IMapIterator.next()')\n"
"        print()\n"
"\n"
"        #\n"
"        # 測試超時\n"
"        #\n"
"\n"
"        print('Testing ApplyResult.get() with timeout:', end=' ')\n"
"        res = pool.apply_async(calculate, TASKS[0])\n"
"        while 1:\n"
"            sys.stdout.flush()\n"
"            try:\n"
"                sys.stdout.write('\\n\\t%s' % res.get(0.02))\n"
"                break\n"
"            except multiprocessing.TimeoutError:\n"
"                sys.stdout.write('.')\n"
"        print()\n"
"        print()\n"
"\n"
"        print('Testing IMapIterator.next() with timeout:', end=' ')\n"
"        it = pool.imap(calculatestar, TASKS)\n"
"        while 1:\n"
"            sys.stdout.flush()\n"
"            try:\n"
"                sys.stdout.write('\\n\\t%s' % it.next(0.02))\n"
"            except StopIteration:\n"
"                break\n"
"            except multiprocessing.TimeoutError:\n"
"                sys.stdout.write('.')\n"
"        print()\n"
"        print()\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"if __name__ == '__main__':\n"
"    multiprocessing.freeze_support()\n"
"    test()\n"

